<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">MABASA- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">Mabasa yoNhumwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bhuku roMabasa yoNhumwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mabasa yoNhumwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mab</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mabasa</para>
  <para style="mt1">yoNhumwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhuku raMabasa rinotohwa senyaya yokuthanga kwoKherekhe nokuingidzika kukura kwayene kubva muJerusarema ichienda kuJudhiya, nokuSamariya, ichimbondoenda dzamara yasvika kurefurefu, maererano nozvidonyaihwa naJesu kuvadzidzi vache asati wakwira kudenga (Mabasa 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhuku rakareri ridonyohwa naRuka, anova mubodzibodziyo adonyora bhuku rinoitiwa Vhangeri ridonyohwa naRuka. Ruka wacho waiva chiremba futi mumanyorero yache wainatsa kudonongodza zvidoitika. Zvinyohwa zvache zvese zvinoti, Vhangeri raRuka naMabasa yoNhumwa zvidonyorehwa munhu waiitiwa Tiyofirasi, waiva muGiriki. Mabhuku yacho yadonyohwa kuti yabatsire ungano dzese dzovatendi, kusanganisa vese vochiGiriki novochiJudha (Mabasa 1:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhuku raMabasa rinogona kunge ridonyohwa pakati pomakore makumi matanhatu kana kuti makumi matanhatu nomanai mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu, nokuti bhuku racho rinopera Phauro asati wasununguhwa mutorongo. Ruka adofambawo noNhumwa Phauro munzendo dzache futi anogona kunge adonyora bhuku raMabasa paanga ari muguta rinoitiwa Andiyoki. Bhuku raMabasa yoNhumwa rinotova Vhangeri raRuka richiri kuenderera kumberi, futi bhuku rakareri rinothanga richinyaira pamusoro paJesu achikwira kudenga. Chikonzero chaRuka chokunyora bhuku rakareri nyhibodzibodzi nochaadonyorera Vhangeri raRuka. Waida kuti Tiyofirasi pabodzi novatendi vanga vachiingidzika mukuwanda kuti vave nochokwadi pamusoro pozvavadodzidzisiwa. Saka adovanyorera nhoroondo yokurarama kwaJesu noyokuenda kunzvimbo dzidowanda kwochiKhirisitu. Bhuku raMabasa rinotipasa muenzaniso wozvanga zvidoita Kherekhe yokuthanga nozvazvanga zvidoita kurarama upenyu hwokutenda muna Jesu. Mienzaniso yese inopasiwa nonhumwa inonangidza matsamiriro yatinofanira kuita kusimba roMweya Mutsvene kuti tigone kuendesa vhangeri kunovamwe vasati varinzva.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo:</para>
  <para style="io1">Chokuthanga Mweya Mutsvene anouya pamusoro ponhumwa zvinodzoita kuti kherekhe ithange kukura (Mabasa 1:1—8:1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chiitiko chochipiri nyhokuti kherekhe inotambudziwa zvoiita kuti ithange kufararira kunze kwoJerusarema (Mabasa 8:2—12:23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mumasure mozvakarezvo Phauro anopinda pahwendo hwache hwokuthanga hwokuenda koshumira vhangeri (Mabasa 12:24—14:28)</para>
  <para style="io1">Padodzoita boka rovakuru ridokumana muJerusarema kuti pave nokutenderana uye kumisikidziwa kwozvinodiwa pakuva mutendi woChibvumirano Chitsva (Mabasa 15:1-35)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mumasure mozvakarezvi Phauro anopinda pahwendo hwache hwochipiri hwokoshumira (Mabasa 15:36—18:22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino Phauro anodzopinda pakamu pahwendo hwache hwoushumiri hwochitatu (Mabasa 18:23—20:38)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino Phauro anodzosungiwa ari muJerusarema (Mabasa 21:1—26:32)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anopedzisira nokuendesewa kuRoma ari musungwa (Mabasa 27:1—28:31).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Tiyofirasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Tiyofirasi, ndidonyora mubhuku rangu rokuthanga pamusoro pozvese zvidothanga kuitiwa nokudzidzisiwa naJesu, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />kusvikira pazuva raadokwidziwa kudenga. Mumasure mokupasa rairo kuburikidza naMweya Mutsvene kunhumwa dzaadosarura. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Vaadozvinangidzawo kwavari nozviratidzo zvidowanditsa kuti mupenyu, mumasure mokutambudzika kwache. Iye adozvinangidza kwavari kwomazuva makumi manai achinyaira pamusoro pozvoumambo hwaMwari. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Adovaraira paanga achija navo achiti, “Rekai kubirika muJerusarema, asi garirirai chipo chidovimbisiwa naBaba vangu chamudonzva ndichinyaira pamusoro pachene. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Nokuti Johwani adoombeka nomvura, asi mumazuva mashomashoma muchaombekewa naMweya Mutsvene.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anokwira Kudenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Manje vadoti vaungana, vadomubvunza, vachiti, “Ishe maakudzotsera umambo kuvaIzirairi nonguwa ino chere?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Hazvinai kufanira kuti muzive nguwa nomisi idotahwa naBaba pachavo nosimba ravo. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Asi muchatambira simba kana Mweya Mutsvene wauya pamusoro penyu, ipopo muchava pfakazi dzangu paJerusarema, nopaJudhiya rese, nopaSamariya, kusvikira kudoperera nyika.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Zvino mumasure mokunyaira zvakarezvi, vadomunangara daipo, adokwidziwa kudenga, uye guti ridomusvisva havanai kudzomuona.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Zvino pavanga vadonangaritsa kudzuru iye achikwira, pakarepo nokamangu vadoona varume vairi vanga vadosimira hembe dzichena vadomira padivi pavo <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />ivo vadoti, “Naimi varume voGaririya, mudomirireiko popano mudonangara kudzuru? Jesu mubodzibodziyu, wabiritsiwa kwamuri achikwidziwa kudenga, achadzoka nonzira ibodzibodzi yamamuona achienda nayo kudenga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matiyasi Anoisiwa Panzvimbo yaJudhasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Pakarepo nhumwa dzidodzokera kuJerusarema dzichibva kugomo rinoitiwa Miorivhi, riri papfupi noJerusarema huri yohwendo hwoSabata kubva muguta. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Pavadopinda muguta vadokwira kukamuri yokumusoro mavanga vachigara. Pita, naJohwani, naJakobho naAndireya, naFiripi naTomasi, naBhatoromiyu naMateo, naJakobho mwanakomana waArufiyasi, naSimoni woushingi, naJudhasi mwanakomana waJakobho. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Ivova vese vadotsungirira nomwoyo mubodzi pakunyengetera, pabodzi novanhukadzi, naMariya amai vaJesu, novanin'ina’ina vache.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Pamazuva yakareyo Pita adosumuka pakati pohama, vanhu vaisvika zana nomakumi mairi achiti, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Hama gwaro rinofanira kuzazisiwa, pamusoro pozvidonyaihwa naMweya Mutsvene, karekare kuburikidza naDhavhiti, maererano nozvaJudhasi adoperekedza vakarevaye vadosunga Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Nokuti wanga adoverengewa pabodzi naisisu, tichitoshanda naye muushumiri hwedu.<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Nomubairo waadobhadhariwa nokuda kwozvidoipa zvache, Judhasi adotenga munda, munova maadowira pasi nomusoro, muviri wache udophabuka nopakati, ura hwache hwese hudobva hwabirika kunze. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Vanhu vese vaigara muJerusarema vadonzva pamusoro pozvakarezvi, saka vadotenza munda wakareyu kuti Akadhama, mumutauro wavo ndokuti, Munda woMagazi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Nokuti mubhuku raMaphisarema mudonyohwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Musha wache mbauve don’o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">mbaureke kuva nomunhu anogara makaremo.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:20">Uye kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Umwe mbaapinde pabasa rache.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Naizvozvo zvinokodzera kusarudza mubodzi pakati povarume vaiungana naisisu nguwa yese Ishe Jesu yaadorarama pakati pedu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kuthangira pakuombeka kwaJohwani kusvikira pazuva Jesu raadobiritsiwa kwatiri, mubodzi pavarume vakareva anofanira kuva pfakazi yokumuka kwache pabodzi naisisu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />saka vadosarudza varume vairi, Josefa waitiwa Bhasabhasi wanga adotenzewa kamu kuti Jusito, naMatiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Pakarepo vadonyengetera vachiti, “Imimi Ishe munoziva mwoyo yovanhu vese, tinangidzei kuti mbani wamasarudza pakati poivova vairi <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kuti atore nzvimbo pabasa rakareri rounhumwa hwakarehu hwudosiiwa naJudhasi achienda kunzvimbo yache chaiyo.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Zvino vadokhanda hakata, hakata idowira pana Matiyasi, iye adoingidzihwa kuboka ronhumwa gumi nomubodzi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kuuya KwaMweya Mutsvene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Zvino zuva roPendekositi paridosvika, vese vanga vari pabodzi, panzvimbo ibodzi. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Pakarepo nokamangu kuunga kudobva kudenga kunenge kwomhepo inovhuvhuta nosimba, kudozaza imba yese mavanga vadogarikika. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Uye vadoona marimi yanenge yomoto, yachiparadzana nokuvhoda pamusoro poumwe noumwe wavo. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Vese vadozaziwa naMweya Mutsvene ndokuthanga kunyaira noimwe mitauro, sekupasiwa kwavadoitiwa naMweya.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Zvino paJerusarema panga padogara vaJudha vaicha Mwari kubva kunyika dzese dzopasi pano. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Pavadonzva kuunga kwakareku gurusvusvu rovanhu ridoungana pabodzi, vadoshamisika maninge ndava umwe noumwe adovanzva vachinyaira nomutauro wache. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Vadokanganisika vese nokushamisika, ndokuti, “Anga ivova vese vanonyairava mbaGaririyaba nai? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Zvino seiko, umwe noumwe wedu tikuvanzva vachinyaira nomutauro wedu watidozvahwa nawo? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />VaPhatiya novaMidhiya novaIrami novanogara kuMesopotamiya, Judhiya noKapadhokiya, Pondasi noEzhiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Firigiya noPhamufiriya, Ijipiti nomativi yonyika dzoRibhiya dziri panyasi noKurini, novarendo vadobva kuRoma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />vaJudha novadopindukira kuchitendero chochiJudha, vaKhirete novaArabhiya, tinovanzva vachinyaira nomitauro yedu mabasa makurufutiyo yaMwari.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Vadoshamisika vese nokukanganisika ndokunyairirana vachiti, “Anga zvakarezvi zvinorevei?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Asi vamwe vadovanyomba vachiti, “Vakorewa nowaini vaimwitsa.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mharidzo YaPita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Asi Pita, adomira novanogumi nomubodzi, adosumudza dzinga rache ndokuvaparidzira achiti, “Varume vokuJudhiya novese vanogara muJerusarema, rekai ndikutsanangurirei zvinhu zvakarevi motetekeretsa zvandinokunyepai. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Nokuti varume vakareva havanai kukorewa sezvamuri kufunga imipa, zvadzichiri nguwa dzochipfemba dzomangwanani. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />asi zvakarezvi ndizvo zvidonyaihwa namuporofiti Juweri achiti,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Mwari anoti mumazuva yokupedzisira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Ndichadurura Mweya wangu pamusoro povanhu vese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">vanakomana venyu novanasikana venyu vachaporofita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">majaha yenyu vachaona zviratidzo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">noharahwa dzenyu dzicharota hope,<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Inde, kana nopamusoro povaranda vangu vanhurume novanhukadzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ndichadurura Mweya wangu, mumazuva yakareyo vachaporofita.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Uye ndichaita zvinoshamisa kudenga kumusoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">nozviratidzo panyika pasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">magazi, nomoto, nokupwititika kwoutsi,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />zuva richasanduriwa kuva rima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">nomwedzi uchasanduriwa kuva gazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">zuva raIshe rikuru rinoshamisa risinati rasvika.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Zvino wese anodaidza kuzita raIshe achaponesewa.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Hama vaIzirairi, tetekerai mashoko yakareya, Jesu woNazareta, murume adoisiwa kwamuri naMwari nomabasa yosimba nozvishamiso nozviratidzo zvidoitiwa naMwari kuburikidza naye pakati penyu, sezvamunozviziva imipa pachenyu, <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Murume wakareyu Jesu, adoisiwa kwamuri maererano nourongwa chaihwo hwaMwari nokuziva kwache zviri kumberi, imipa mudomurovera pamuchinjikwa ndokumubaya kuburikidza nomanja yovanhu vadoipa. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Asi Mwari adomumutsa, kubva kuvadopfa achimusunungura kubva kumahwadzo yoipfa, nokuti zvaikonekaba kuti ipfayo irambe idomubata. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Nokuti Dhavhiti adonyaira pamusoro pache achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Ndidoona Ishe pamberi pangu nguwa dzese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">nokuti ari kuruji kwangu, kuti ndireke kugwetedzewa.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Nokudaro mwoyo wangu unofara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">nochirimi changu chinofaritsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">uyewo muviri wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">uchazorora mutariro,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />nokuti munosiyaba mweya wangu uri munzvimbo yovadopfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">kana kutendera Mutsvene wenyu kuti aone kuora.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Mudondizivisa nzira dzoupenyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">muchandizaza nokufara muhuvepo hwenyu.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Hama vaIzirairi, ndinokunyairirai pachenu zvateteguru vedu Dhavhiti, kuti iye adopfa, ndokuvikhiwa, guwa rache riri pakati pedu kusvikira nasi <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Asi wanga ari muporofiti, waiziva kuti Mwari adomupikira mhiko yokuti achagadza pamupando wache woushe umwe wozvizvahwa zvache. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />adoona zvanga zvichidzouya pamberi, ndokunyaira pamusoro pokumuka kwoMuponisi, kuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">haanai kusiiwa ari munzvimbo yovadopfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">nomuviri wache haunai kuona kuora.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Mwari adomutsa wakareyu Jesu kubva kuvadopfa isisu tese tiri pfakazi dzozvakarezvi. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Zvino paadosumudzihwa kujanja roruji raMwari, adopasiwa chipikihwa choMweya Mutsvene kubva kunaBaba, wadzodurura zvakarezvi zvamuri kuona nokunzva. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Nokuti Dhavhiti haanai kukwira kudenga, asi iye adoti pachake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Ishe adoti kuna Ishe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">garikika kujanja rangu roruji,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />kusvikira ndaita vavengi vako chitsiko chotsoka dzako.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Zvino imba yese yovaIzirairi mbaizvizivitsitse kuti Jesu wakareyu, wamudorovera, Mwari adomuita zvese Ishe naMuponisi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Zvino vanhu pavadonzva zvakarezvi, vadobaiwa pamwoyo ndokuti kuna Pita nodzimwe nhumwa, “Hama, anga manje toita tini?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Pita adoti kwavari, “Pindukai umwe noumwe wenyu aombekewe muzita raJesu Khirisitu kuti murekerehwe zvitema zvenyu, uye muchatambira chipo choMweya Mutsvene. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Nokuti chipikihwa nyhenyu novana venyu, novese vari kurefurefu vachadzodaidziwa naIshe Mwari wedu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Uye adopfakaza noyamwe mashoko mazinji achivayambira nokuvakohomedza achiti, “Zviponesei kubva parudzi rakareri ridoipa.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Zvino avo vadotambira shoko rache vadoombekewa, zuva rakarero vanhu vanoda kusvika kuzviuru zvitatu vadoingidzihwa kuungano yavo. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Vadozvipira kudzidziso dzonhumwa nopakuwadzana, nopakukomora mazingwa, nopaminyengetero.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mugariro Wovatendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Kucha kudouya kuvanhu vese, nokuda kwozvishamiso nozviratidzo zvizinji zvidoitiwa nonhumwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Vatendi vese vanga vari pabodzi vaiti zvinhu zvese nzvedu tese. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Vadotengesa pfuma yavo nozvinhu ndokuzvikovera kuno vese, umwe noumwe pakushaiwa kwache. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Zuva rimwe norimwe, vaikumana muimba yaMwari vari pabodzi, vachikomora mazingwa mudzimba dzavo, vachija zvokuja zvavo nomufaro, nomwoyo udonaka, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Vachirumbidza Mwari, vachidiwa novanhu vese, zuva rimwe norimwe Ishe adoingidzira vaiponesewa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Munhu Adoremara Adoporesewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Zvino rimwe zuva Pita naJohwani vanga vachienda kuimba yaMwari nonguwa yomunamato, iri nguwa yochipfemba. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Murume wanga adoremara kubva pakuzvahwa, wanga achitakuhwa mazuva yese, vachimuisa pamusuwo woimba yaMwari udotenzewa kuti Suwo Ridonaka kuitira ambokumbira zvipo kubva kuno vaipinda muimba yaMwari. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Paadoona Pita naJohwani vaakutoda kupinda muimba yaMwari, adovakumbira mari. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Zvino Pita naJohwani vadomunangaritsa, pakarepo Pita ndokuti, “Tinangare!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Iye ndokunangara kwavari achigurupira kutambira chinhu kubva kwavari. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Asi Pita adoti kwaari, “Sirivha nondarama handinai, asi ndinokupasa chandinacho, muzita raJesu Khirisitu woNazareta tekaira.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Adomubata janja roruji, ndokumusumudza, pakarepo tsoka dzache nozviziso zvotsoka zvidosimbisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Adochiruka ndokutekaira achipinda muimba yaMwari navo, achitekaira nokuchiruka achirumbidza Mwari. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Uye vanhu vese vadomuona achitekaira achirumbidza Mwari, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />vadomuziva, kuti ndiye waigara pasuwo rinoitiwa Ridonaka roimba yaMwari achikumbira zvipo, vadokanganisika nokushamisika nozvidoitika kwaari.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mharidzo yaPita muImba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Zvino murume paanga achidobatirira kunaPita naJohwani, vanhu vese vadoshamisika ndokuuya vachitizira kwavari paberere raiitiwa raSoromoni. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Manje Pita paadoona zvakarezvi, adoti kwavari, “Hama dzangu vaIzirairi, mashamisiwa neiko pamusoro pozvakarezvi, ndavayei muchitinangaritsa sekunge nhisu taita kuti murume wakareyu atekaire nosimba redu, kana nokururama kwedu? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Mwari waAbhurahamu nowaIsaki nowaJakobho, naMwari womadzibaba vedu, ndiye adokudza muranda wache Jesu, wamudopandukira uye mukamuramba pamberi paPirato, iye wasarudza kuti amusunungure. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Asi imimi mudoramba iye Mutsvene adorurama, mudokumbira kuti musunungurihwe mhondi, <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mudobaya muvambi woupenyu, asi Mwari adomumutsa kubva kuvadopfa kudeiku isisu tiri pfakazi dzozvakarezvi. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Nokutenda muzita raJesu murume wakareyu wamuri kuona nowamunoziva waporesewa, uye kutenda kwache muna Jesu ndiko kwaita kuti murume wakareyu adomira pamberi penyu aporesewe sezvamuri kuona mese.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Asi zvino, hama dzangu vaIzirairi, ndinoziva kuti mudozviita nokusaya kuziva ndomwenze vatungamiri venyuwo pakamu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Asi yakareya ndiyo mazazisiro yaadoita Mwari pano zvaadonyaira kuburikidza novaporofiti vese achizivisa kuti, Khirisitu waidzotambudzika. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Pindukai ndipo, mudzokere kuna Mwari, kuitira kuti zvitadzo zvenyu zvidzimiwe, kuti nguwa dzokusanduriwa dzinobva kuna Ishe dzisvike, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />kuti atume Muponisi Jesu waadogadza nokuda kwenyu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Iye anofanira kuramba ari kudenga kusvikira nguwa yasvika yokuti zvinhu zvese zviitiwe zvitsva sezvidovimbisiwa naMwari kare kuburikidza novaporofiti vache vatsvene. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Nokuti Mozisi adoti, ‘Ishe Mwari wenyu achakumutsirai muporofiti adofanana nainini kubva pakati pohama dzenyu. Munofanira kumutetekera pazvese zvaanokunyepai. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Wese asingamutetekere achaparadziwa zvachose kubva pavanhu.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />NovaPorofiti vese vadonyaira, kubva panaSamueri novadodzomutevera pamasure, vadonyairawo zvomazuva yakareyano. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Imimi muri vaji vonhaka yovaPorofiti, novosungano yaMwari yaadoita nomadzibaba venyu. Paadoti kuna Abhurahamu, ‘Kuburikidza novana vako vanhu vese vopanyika vacharopafadziwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Mwari paadomutsa wache, adothanga kumutuma kwamuri kuti akuropafadzei achidzotsa umwe noumwe wenyu kubva panzira dzenyu dzidoipa.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Pita naJohwani Pamberi poDare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Pavanga vachiri kunyaira novanhu, vaphirisita nomukuru wovachengeti voimba yaMwari novaSadhusi vadouya kwavari, <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />vadokaripa nokuti vanga vachidzidzisa vanhu nokuparidza zvokumuka kwovadopfa muna Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Vadovasunga ndokuvaisa mutorongo kusvika mangwana mangwanani, nokuti kwanga kwadoka. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Asi vazinji panovadonzva shoko vadotenda, uwandu hwovarume vanga vakutoda kusvika zviuru zvishano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Nozuva ridotevera vatongi vavo novakuru novadzidzisi vomutemo vadoungana pabodzi muJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Anasi muphirisita mukuru naKefasi naJohwani naArekizanda, novamwe vomhuri yomuphirisita mukuru. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Pavadoisa Pita naJohwani pakati pavo, vadovabvunzitsitsa vachiti, “Mudozviita nosimba ripi kana nozita ripi zvakarezvi?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Ipopo Pita, adozara naMweya Mutsvene, adoti kwavari, “Vatongi vovanhu novakuru, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />kana tiri kubvunzitsitsiwa nasi pamusoro pobasa ridonaka ridoitihwa munhu adoremara, kuti adoporesewa tini, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />mbazvizikane naimimi mese, novaIzirairi vese, kuti nozita raJesu Khirisitu woNazareta, wamudorovera pamuchinjikwa, iye adomutsiwa naMwari kuvadopfa, nozita rakareri munhu wakareyu adomira pano pamberi penyu wapora. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Rakareri ndiro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘ribwe ridorambiwa naimimi vavakhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">asi ridodzova musoro wokhona.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Uye hapanai ruponiso kunoumwe, nokuti hapanai rimwe zita pasi podenga ridopasiwa pakati povanhu, ratingaponesewe naro.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Zvino pavadoona zvivindi zvaPita naJohwani, vachiona kuti vanga vasinai kudzidza, vari vanhuwo zvavo, vadoshamisiwa nazvo, vadobva vaziva kuti vanga vanaJesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Asi vachiona munhu wanga waporesewa wacho adomira padivi pavo, vadosairafuti zvokunyaira vachivapikisa. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Saka vadovaraira kuti vabirike pamberi podare, pakarepo ndokurangana pakati pavo. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />“Tichaita tiniko novarume vakareva?” Nokuti chiratidzo chavaita chiri pachenu kuvanhu vese vanogara muJerusarema, uye tinozvirambaba. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Asi kuti zvireke kuramba zvichipararira pakati povanhu, mbativatsindikire kuti damba wanyaira nomunhu upi noupi nozita rakareri.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Saka vadovadaidza ndokuvatsindikira kuti varekeretu kudzonyaira kana kudzidzisa kamu nozita raJesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Asi Pita naJohwani vadovapindura vachiti, “Zvingave zvidonaka pamberi paMwari nai kuti tikutetekerei imipa pano kuti titetekere Mwari, imipa tongai. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Nokuti isisu tinokonaba kureka kunyaira zvatidoona nokunzva.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Zvino pavadoingidzira kuvachichidzira, vadovarekera vadosaya kuti vanovarova tini, nokuda kwovanhu; nokuti vese vadorumbiza Mwari nozvidoitiwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Nokuti munhu wanga waitihwa chiratidzo chakarechi chokuporesewa wanga waanomakore makumi manai yachiraudza.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatendi Vanonamatira Ushingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Pavadosununguriwa vadodzokera kwanga kuna abiyavo ndokuvanyepa zvese zvanga zvanyairiwa kwavari novaphirisita vakuru novakuru. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ivo pavadozvinzva, vadosumudza mazvi yavo pabodzi mumunamato kunaMwari vachiti, “Ishe, imimi mudoita denga nonyika nogungwa nozvese zviri mukati mazvene, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />mudonyaira naMweya Mutsvene kuburikidza nomuromo womuranda wenyu Dhavhiti baba vedu, paadoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Ko yamwe Marudzi vasiri vaJudha vadokaripireiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">novanhu vadofungireiko zvinhu zvisinai kabonyo?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Madzimambo vonyika vadotozvigadzirira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">novatongi vadoungana pabodzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">kudzohwisana naIshe noMuzodziwa wache.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Nokuti nzvochokwadi kuti Herudhe naPondiyasi Pirato vadoungana pabodzi, novoyamwe Marudzi vasiri vaJudha, novana vaIzirairi muguta rino kuti vahwisane nomuranda wenyu mutsvene Jesu wamudozodza. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Vadoita zvamanga mudosarudza kare nosimba renyu nochido chenyu kuti zviitiwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Zvino, Ishe, nangarai kutsindikira kwavo, batsirai varanda venyu kuti vanyaire shoko renyu vano ushingi hwese. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Tambanudzai janja renyu kuti muporese nokuita zviratidzo nozvishamiso kuburikidza nozita romuranda wenyu mutsvene Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Zvino vadoti vanyengetera, nzvimbo yavanga vadoungana pabodzi idogwetera, uye vese vadozaziwa naMweya Mutsvene, ndokunyaira shoko raMwari nochivindi.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatendi Vanokoverana Zvinhu Zvavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Zvino gurusvusvu rovanotenda vanga vanomwoyo nomweya mubodzi, panga pasinai waiti chinhu chaanacho nyhache wega, asi zvinhu zvese vadoti nzvavo vese. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Nosimba rikuru nhumwa dzidopfakaza nozvokumuka kwaIshe Jesu, mutsa mukuru ndokuva pamusoro pavo vese. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Hapanai kudzova nomunhu waisaya chinhu pakati pavo, ndava vese vanga vanominda kana dzimba vadotengesa, vachiuya nomari yozvinhu zvavanga vatengesa, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ndokuyiisa pamberi ponhumwa. Mari idokovehwa munhu umwe noumwe pakushaiwa kwache.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Uye Josefa adotenzewa nonhumwa kuti Bhanabhasi, (ndokuti mwanakomana wokukurudzira), Murevhi, nzvahwa yokuSaipurasi, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />adotengesa munda wache, ndokuuya nomari achiiisa patsoka dzonhumwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiyasi naSafira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Zvino murume waiitiwa Ananiyasi pabodzi nomukadzi wache Safira vadotengesawo munda. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Asi iye adozvikamurira imwe mari kubva pano yaadowana pakutengesa, mukadzi wache wanga achizviziva, ndokuuyisa chikamu basi ndokuisa pamberi ponhumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Pakarepo Pita adoti, “Ananiyasi, Sathani wazazireiko mwoyo wako kuti ubhwodokere Mweya Mutsvene, nokuzvikamurira imwe mari kubva pamutengo womunda? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Pawanga usinati watengesewa, wanga usiri wako chere? Wabva kutengesewa mariyo njakoba, waita tiniko kufunga kuita chinhu chidodaichi mumwoyo mako? Manje haunai kubhwodokera vanhu, asi Mwari.” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananiyasi paadonzva mashoko yakareya, adokomoka ndokuwira pasi nokupfirafuti. Kucha kukuru kudobata vese vadozvinzva. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Pakarepo majaha vadosumuka vachiputiridza mutumbi wache ndokuubiritsa panze vachienda komuviga.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Padopera chinguwa chomaawa matatu mukadzi wache adopinda, asingazive zvanga zvaitika. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Pita adoti kwaari, “Ndinyepe yakarei ndiyo mari yamudowana chere pamudotengesa munda?” Iye adoti, “Inde ndiyoyo.’’<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Zvino Pita adoti kwaari, “Ndavayei mabvumirana pabodzi kuyedza Mweya waIshe nangara ndipo, tsoka dzovabva koviga murume wako dziri pamusuwo, uye vachakubiritsawo panze.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Pakarepo adokomoka ndokuwira pasi patsoka dzache ndokupfawo. Majaha pavadodzopinda vadomuwana watopfa ndokumubiritsa panze vachienda komuviga padivi pomurume wache. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Kucha kukuru kudobata Kherekhe yese, novese vadonzva pamusoro pozviitiko zvakarezvi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minana Nozvishamiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Manje zviratidzo zvizinji nozvinoshamisa zvidoitiwa pakati povanhu nomanja yonhumwa. Uye vese vanga vari pabodzi vari paberere raSoromoni, <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Pakati pavo panga pasinai munhu adotsunga kubatana navo, asi vairemekedzewa zvikuru novanhu. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Zvisinei vatendi vadowanda, vanhurume novanhukadzi vadoramba vachiingidzihwa kuna Ishe. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Nokudaro vadoisa vahwere munzira vachivaradzika pamibhedha nopamaponde, kuti kana Pita waakupinda nopakarepo mumvurimvuri wache usvike panovamwe vavo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Vanhu vadobvawo mumaguta yadopoteredza Jerusarema, vadoungana vachiuya novahwere novaitambudziwa nomweya idoipa, vese vadoporesewa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhumwa DzinoTambudziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Asi muphirisita mukuru adosumuka novese vaanga anavo, vanga vari vobato rovaSadhusi, vanga vanochanje chaizvo; <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />vadosunga nhumwa ndokudziisa mutorongo maiisiwa vanhu vese. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Asi usiku ngirozi yaIshe idovhura misuwo yotorongo, ichivabiritsa ichiti, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Endai komira muimba yaMwari munyairire vanhu mashoko yese youpenyu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Pavadonzva zvakarezvi, vadopinda muimba yaMwari kwaakuchena ndokudzidzisa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Manje muphirisita mukuru naabiyache pavadosvika, vadokokorodza makorokota nodare rese rovaIzirairi, ndokutuma vanhu kovatora kutorongo. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Asi varanda pavadosvika, havanai kuvawana mutorongo, vadodzoka vachivanyepa zvakarezvo vachiti, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Tawana torongo ridozaririwa zvidosimba, novachengeti votorongo vadomira pamisuwo, asi patavhura hatinai kuwana munhu mukati!” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Zvino mukuru wovachengeti voimba yaMwari novaphirisita vakuru pavadonzva mashoko yakareya, vadokanganisiwa nayo, vachinetseka kuti zvinodzoita tini zvakarezvi. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Pakarepo umwe adobva wasvika achivanyepa achiti, “Varume vamudoisa mutorongo vaye vari muimba yaMwari, vakutodzidzisa vanhu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Pakarepo mukuru wovachengeti voimba yaMwari adoenda novatariri vache kovatora, asi vasingaite zvokuvakikiritsa, ndava vanga vachicha kuti vanhu vangavateme nomabhwe.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Pavadosvika navo, vadovapereka kumakorokota. Muphirisita mukuru adovabvunza, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />achiti, “Tidokutsindikiraiba kasingapere kuti rekai kudzidzisa nozita rakareri, manje nangarai matozaza Jerusarema nodzidziso yenyu, munoda kuti gazi romunhu wakareyu ritipfukire nai.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Asi Pita nonhumwa vadopindura vachiti, “Tinofanira kutetekera Mwari kupinda vanhu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Mwari womadzibaba vedu adomutsa Jesu kuvadopfa, iye wamudobaya muchimuturika pamuchinjikwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Mwari adomusumudzira iye kujanja rache roruji kuti ave mutungamiri nomuponisi, kuti apase vaIzirairi kupinduka nokukangamwihwa zvitema. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Isisu tiri pfakazi dzozvinhu zvakarezvi, pabodzi naMweya Mutsvene adopasiwa naMwari kuna ivo vanomutetekera.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Pavadonzva zvakarezvi vadokaripitsa zvokutoda kuvabaya. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Asi umwe muFarisi mudaremo waiitiwa Gamarieri, mudzidzisi womutemo, wairemekedzewa novanhu vese, adosumuka ndokuraira kuti, varume vabiritsiwe panze kwokanguwa kadikidiki. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Adoti kwavari, “Varume vaIzirairi, ngwarirai zvamunoda kuitira vanhu vakareva. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Nokuti kare Tudhasi adomuka, achizviti ndiri munhu mukuru, uye vanhu vanosvika mazana manai vadobatana naye, asi iye adobaiwa novese vanga vachimutevera vadopwamwadziwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Mumasure mowakareyu Judhasi woGaririya adomuka kamu pamazuva yokuverengewa, vanhu vadomutevera, iye adopararawo novese vaimutevera vadopwamwadziwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Nokudaro panyaya yakarei ndinokunyepai vanhu vakareva rekai kuvabata, nokuti kana kufunga kwakareku nobasa rakareri zviri zvovanhu, zvichaparara. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Asi kana zviri zvaMwari, hamukwanisi kuvakunda, ndava mungadzodaro muchipikisana naMwari!”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Nokudaro vadomutetekera, vadodaidza nhumwa vachipinda, vadovashapura ndokuvatsindikira kuti vareke kudzonyaira nozvozita raJesu, ndokuvarekera vachienda. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Pakarepo vadobirika pamakorokota vachifara, kuti naivowo vadokodzera kutambudziwa nokuda kwozita rache. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Uye mazuva yese vadorekaba kudzidzisa nokuparidza muimba yaMwari nomudzimba vachiti Jesu ndiye Khirisitu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Vabatsiri Vanomwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Zvino nomazuva yakareyo vadzidzi pavanga vawanditsa, vaGiriki, vadonyunyutira vaHebheru ndava chirikadzi dzavo dzanga dzichitharukiwa pakukovehwa zvokuja kwaiitiwa zuva rimwe norimwe. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Zvino vanogumi novairi vadodaidza dare rovadzidzi ndokuti, “Hazvinai kunaka kuti isisu tisiye kuparidza shoko raMwari tichishanda pamatafura. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Saka hama dzangu sarudzai pakati penyu varume vanomwe vanopfakazihwa zvidonaka, vadozara noMweya nouchenjeri vatingaise pabasa rakareri. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Asi isisu tichazvipa pakunyengetera nopabasa rokuparidza shoko.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Zvavadonyairazvo zvidofadza gurusvusvu rese; vachibva vasarudza Sitefani murume wanga adozara nokutenda naMweya Mutsvene, naFiripi, naPorokoro, naNikanori, naTimoni, naPamenasi naNikorasi wanga adopindukira kuchitendero chochiJudha wokuAndiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Vakareva vadovaisa pamberi ponhumwa, ivo vadonamata nokuturika manja pamusoro pavo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Saka shoko raMwari ridokura, uwandu hwovadzidzi hwudoingidzika chaizvo paJerusarema, novaphirisita vazinjifutivo vadotenda.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusungiwa kwaSitefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Zvino Sitefani, murume wanga adozara nomutsa waMwari nosimba, adoita zvinoshamisa zvikuru nozviratidzo pakati povanhu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ipopo vamwe vanga vari vosinagoge raiva rovanhu vaiitiwa Vadosununguka sezvaraidaidziwa, novaKureni, novaArekizanda, noavo vaibva kuKirikiya noEzhiya, vadosumuka vachiita nharo naSitefani. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Asi havanai kukwanisa kukunda kuchenjera kwaadopasiwa naMweya paainyaira. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ipopo vadomutsa vamwe varume muchihwande, vachiti kwavari, “Nyairai kuti tidomunzva achinyaira mashoko yokushora Mozisi naMwari.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Saka vadopesvedzera vanhu novakuru novadzidzisi vomutemo. Vadobata Sitefani ndokumuisa pamberi pomakorokota yodare. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />vadomuisira pfakazi dzomabhwodo dzidoti, “Munhu wakareyu anorekaba kunyaira mashoko yokushora nzvimbo yakarei itsvene nomutemo. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ndava tidomunzva kamu achiti uyu Jesu woNazareta achaparadza nzvimbo yakarei, uye achasandura tsika dzatidopasiwa naMozisi.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Zvino vese vanga vadogarikika mudare vadonangaritsa Sitefani, ndokuona chiso chache chaita kunge chiso chongirozi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Sitefani Anozvipindurira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Pakarepo muphirisita mukuru adoti, “Zvakarezvi ndizvo chere?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Zvino Sitefani adoti, “Hama nanababa, nditetekereiwo! Mwari wokubhwinya adozviratidza kuna baba vedu Abhurahamu, pavanga vachiri muMesopotamiya, vasati vaakugara kuHarani, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />adoti kwaari, ‘Birika munyika yako nokuhama dzako uende kunyika yandichakunangidza.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ipopo adobirika munyika yovaKhedhiya, ndokuenda kogara kuHarani. Mumasure mokupfa kwababa vache, adomutumira kunyika iyoyi yamuri kugara iyezvino. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Asi haanai kumupasa nhaka makaremo kana pangatsike tsoka yache chaipo, asi Mwari adomuvimbisa kuti achamupasa kuti ive yache novana vache vaidzotevera, asinati watova nomwanayo. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Mwari adonyaira achiti, vana vache vachava vatohwa kunyika yovamwe, vachavaita varanda nokuvaonesa pfumvu kwomakore mazana manai. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />‘Asi ndicharanga nyika yakareyo ichavaita varanda,’ ndizvo zvidonyaira Mwari, ‘mumasure mozvakarezvo vachabirika kuti vandinamate panzvimbo ino.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Adomupasa chibvumirano chokuchecheudziwa. Nokudaro Abhurahamu adozvara Isaki, ndokumuchecheudza nozuva rochisere, Isaki adozvara Jakobho, uye Jakobho ndiye adozvara madziteteguru gumi novairi.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Nondava yokuti madziteteguru vanga vanochanje naJosefa, vadomutengesera kuIjipiti semuranda, asi Mwari wanga anaye, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />adomununura papfumvu dzache dzese, adopasa Josefa mutsa nouchenjeri pamberi paFarao, mambo woIjipiti, uyo adomuita mutongi woIjipiti nowomuzinda wache wese. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Zvino kudouya nzara muIjipiti yese nomuKhenani, nokutambura kukuru, madzibaba vedu vadosaya zvokuja. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Asi Jakobho paadonzva kuti kuIjipiti kuno chikafu, adotuma madzibaba vedu pakuthanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Pahwendo hwochipiri Josefa adozvizivisa kuvakoma vache, uye rudzi raJosefa ridozikana naFarao. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Zvino Josefa adotuma vakoma kotora Jakobho baba vache pabodzi nohama dzache dzese, vanhu makumi manomwe novashano. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Pakarepo Jakobho adoenda kuIjipiti, kunova kwaadodzopfira iye nomadzibaba vedu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mitumbi yavo idodzotsehwa kuShekemu ndokuvigiwa muguwa ranga ridotengewa naAbhurahamu kuvanakomana vaHamori, nomutengo womari inochitsama.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Asi nguwa yochipikihwa chidopikihwa Abhurahamu naMwari payanga yaakusvika, uwandu hwovanhu vedu hwanga hwakuritsa muIjipiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Pakarepo padodzomuka umwe mambo muIjipiti wanga asingazive Josefa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Iye adoitira utsinye rudzi redu ndokumanikidza madzibaba vedu kuti vataye vana vavo vacheche vachandozvahwa, kuti vapfe. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Panguwa yakareyo ndopadozvahwa Mozisi, wanga adonaka. Adorerewa mwedzi mitatu ari mumba mababa vache, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />zvino pavadodzomuisa kunze, adohwengewa nomwanasikana waFarao achimurera semwanakomana wache. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Mozisi adodzidzisiwa uchenjeri hwese hwovaIjipiti, adova nosimba pamashoko nopamabasa.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Paanga wava nomakore makumi manai, adosarudza kubvakachira hama dzache, vana vaIzirairi. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Adoona umwe wavo achishushiwa nomuIjipiti adohwira nyakushushiwa ndokumutsivira kuburikidza nokubaya muIjipiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Mozisi adofunga kuti hama dzachedzo dzichanzvitsitsa kuti Mwari wanga achivapasa dzikinuro kuburikidza naiye, asi havanai kuzvinzvitsitsa. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Mangwana chimuka adosvika kwavari ndokuona vana vaIzirairi vairi vachirovana, adoedza kuvayananisa achiti, ‘Varume, mbukama hwenyu, sei muchihwisana?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Asi nyakubata uyanga mabiyache adogwididzira Mozisi kudodaro uko, achiti, ‘Ko iwewe mbani wakuita mambo nomutongi wedu popa? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Unoda kundibaya nai kunge zvaudoita muIjipiti nezuro?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Paadonzva mashoko yakareya, Mozisi adobva watizira kunyika yoMidhiyeni. Kwaadogara semutohwa uye adozvara vanakomana vairi kwakareko.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Zvino padopera makore makumi manai, ngirozi idozviratidza kwaari musango rogomo roSinai murimi romoto waipfuta padzambwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mozisi paadozviona adoshamisika nazvo, uye paadonyedza papfupi kuti aonetsetse, adonzva dzinga raIshe ridokuwa richiti, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ndini Mwari womadzibaba vako, Mwari waAbhurahamu, nowaIsaki nowaJakobho.’ Ipopo Mozisi adocha kunangaritsa. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Zvino Ishe adoti kwaari, ‘Biritsa shangu patsoka dzako nokuti ipopo paudomira panzvimbo itsvene. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Ndaonetsetsa chokwadi kudzvanyirihwa kwovanhu vangu vari muIjipiti, ndanzva kugomera kwavo, saka ndaburuka kudzovahwira, zvino chiuya ndikutume kuIjipiti.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Ndiyeyu Mozisi mubodzibodzi wavadoramba vachiti mbani adokuita mambo nomutongi wedu? Ndiye adotumiwa naMwari kuburikidza nongirozi yaadoona padzambwa, kuti ave mutongi nomudzikinuri wavo. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Iye adovabiritsa, achiita zvinoshamisa nozviratidzo munyika yoIjipiti nopaGungwa Ritsvuku nomusango, kwomakore makumi manai. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Ndiyeyu Mozisi adoti kuvana vaIzirairi, ‘Mwari achakumutsirai muporofiti adofanana nainini, kubva kuvanhu venyu. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ndiyeyu wanga ari kuungano musango, nongirozi idonyaira naye muGomo roSinai, nomadzibaba vedu vanga varipo, adotambira mashoko mapenyu yokudzotipasa.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Asi madzibaba, vedu vadoramba kumutetekera, vadomuramba ndokudzokera kuIjipiti mumwoyo yavo. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Vadoti kuna Aroni tiitire vamwari vatitungamirire, nokuti Mozisi adotibiritsa munyika yoIjipiti, tinozivaba zvidoitika kwaari. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Zvino vadoita chimhuru nomazuva yakareyo, vadotouya nochibairo kuchimufananidzo chavo, vadofarira mabasa yomanja yavo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Zvino Mwari adovapira gotsi ndokuvasiya daipo kuti vanamate zuva, mwedzi nonyenyedzi, sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa mubhuku rovaporofiti zvichinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Hamunai kundivigira zvipiriso nozvibairo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">makore makumi manai musango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">vana vaIzirairi.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Mudosumudza dumba rokukumanira raMoroki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">nonyenyedzi yamwari wenyu Refani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">zvimifananidzo zvamudoita kuti muzvinamate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">uye ndichakutamisai kumberi kwoBhabhironi.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Madzibaba vedu vanga vano dumba rochibvumirano musango, ranga ridovakhiwa sekunyaira kudoita Mwari kuna Mozisi, zvichienderana nomufananidzo waanga awona. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Madzibaba vedu, vadopinda naro naJoshuwa munyika ino yavadotora kubva kumarudzi, yadodzingidziwa naMwari pamberi pomadzibaba vedu, kusvikira pamazuva yaDhavhiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Iye adonzvihwa mutsa pamberi paMwari, ndokukumbira kuvakhira Mwari waJakobho pokugara. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Asi Soromoni ndiye adodzomuvakhira imba.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Asi Wokumusorosoro anogaraba mudzimba dzidovakhiwa nomanja, sezvidorehwa nomuporofiti achiti,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Denga ndomupando wangu woushe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">nyika nyhitsiko chotsoka dzangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">zvino muchandivakhira imba idotiniko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Kana nzvimbo yandingazororere njipi?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ko janja rangu ndiroba ridoita zvesezvi nai?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Imipa vanhu vomitsipa mikukutu musinai kuchecheudziwa mwoyo nonzeve, munogara muchisvanika Mweya Mutsvene, kunge madzibaba venyu ndomwenze naimipa kamu. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Mbani pakati povaporofiti asinai kutambudziwa nomadzibaba venyu? Vadovabaya ivo vaiparidza kuuya kwoAdorurama, Iye wamudopandukira nokubaya. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Imipa mudopasiwa mutemo sezvaudoraihwa nongirozi, mukareka kuuteedzera.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefani anotakiwa nomatombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Zvino vakuru vodare pavadonzva zvinhu zvakarezvi, vadokaripa vachigedageda meno kwaari. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Asi Sitefani adozara naMweya Mutsvene, adonangaritsa kudenga, akaona kuyetima kwaMwari, naJesu adomira kujanja roruji raMwari, <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />adoti, “Onai, ndinoona denga razuruka, noMwanakomana womunhu adomira kujanja roruji raMwari.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Zvino vadodaidzira noizvi rikuru, ndokusvikitira nzeve dzavo, ndokutizirana pabodzi kuenda kwaari, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />vadomuzvuvira kunze kwoguta, ndokumutaka nomatombo, pfakazi dzidoisa mabhachi yadzene patsoka dzojaha raiitiwa Sauro. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Pavanga vachimutema nomatombo Sitefani, adonamata achiti, “Ishe Jesu tambirai mweya wangu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Adopfugama, ndokunamata kamu noizvi rikuru achiti, “Ishe, rekai kuvapasa murandu wochitema chakarechi.” Adoti wanyaira zvakarezvi adobva wapfa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sauro wanga achibvumirana nokubaiwa kwache.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sauro Anotambudza Kherekhe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Zvino pazuva rakarero kutambudziwa kukuru kwokherekhe muJerusarema kudomuka, vadopwamwadziwa vese vachienda mumatunhu yese yoJudhiya noSamariya, ndokundosara nhumwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Varume vadorurama vadoviga Sitefani, vachimurira zvidokungudza.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Asi Sauro adothanga kuparadza kherekhe, achipinda imba noimba, achizvuzvurudza vanhurume novanhukadzi achivaisa mutorongo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vhangeri Rinoparidziwa muSamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Zvino avo vadopwamwadziwa vadoenda vachiparidza shoko. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Firipi adoenda kuzasi kuguta roSamariya, achiparidza Khirisitu kwavari. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Gurusvusvu ridotetekera nomwoyo mubodzi zvainyaihwa naFiripi, vachinzva nokuona zviratidzo zvaanga achiita. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Nokuti mweya yotsvina idobirika muvanhu vazinji vanga vadopotehwa nayo, ichikuwa noruzha rikuru, uye vazinji vanga vari zvirema nomhetamakumbo vadoporesewa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Nokudaro mudova nomufaro mukuru muguta rakarero.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Asi kare kwanga kuno murume waiitiwa Simoni waimboita zvomapipi mugutamo achishamisa vanhu voSamariya, achitodumba kuti iye mukuru. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Vese vaiteerera kwaari, kubva pamudiki kusvika kumukuru, vachiti, “Murume wakareyu anoitiwa Simba Rikuru raMwari.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Vadomutevera ndava wanga wavashamisa kwonguwa irefu nomapipi yache. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Asi pavadotenda Firipi paaiparidza nyaya idonaka pamusoro poumambo hwaMwari nozita raJesu Khirisitu, vadoombekewa, vese vanhurume novanhukadzi <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Naiyewo Simoni pachake adotenda, mumasure mokuombekewa adoramba achitevera Firipi kwesekwese, achishamisiwa paaiona zviratidzo zvikuru nominana zvaiitiwa naFiripi.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Zvino nhumwa paJerusarema pavadonzva kuti Samariya ratambira shoko raMwari, vadotuma Pita naJohwani kwavari, <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />ivo vadoenda kovanamatira kuti vatambire Mweya Mutsvene, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />nokuti wanga unati waburuka kana nokumubodzi wavo zvache, asi vanga vandoombekewa muzita raIshe Jesu basi. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Ipopo vadoturika manja yavo pamusoro pavo vachibva vatambira Mweya Mutsvene.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Manje Simoni paadoona kuti Mweya wapasiwa nokuturikiwa pamusoro kwomanja yonhumwa, adovapasa mari, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />achiti, “Ndipaseiwo simba rakareri, kuti wese wandinenge ndaturika manja yangu pamusoro atambire Mweya Mutsvene.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Asi Pita adoti kwaari, “Sirivha yako mbaiparadziwe pabodzi naiwewe, nokuti udofunga kuti ungatenge chipo chaMwari nomari! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Haunai chikamu kana mugove pachinhu chakarechi, nokuti mwoyo wako haunai kukohoroka pamberi paMwari. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Pinduka ndipo paunyangadzi hwakohu, unamate kuna Ishe kuti, kana zvichikwanisika, uregerehwe pachinangwa chomwoyo wako. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Nokuti ndinoona kuti udozara noukari nochanje uri musungwa wochitadzo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Pakarepo Simoni adopindura achiti, “Ndinamatirei kuna Ishe, kuti pareke kuva nochibodzi chozvamanyaira chingandiwire.” <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Zvino vadoti vapfakaza nokunyaira shoko raIshe, vadodzokera kuJerusarema, vachiparidza nyaya idonaka kumisha mizinji yomuSamariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Firipi noMukurumukuru woItopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Asi ngirozi yaIshe idoti kuna Firipi, “Sumuka, uende udonanga kuchamhembe kunzira inodzika ichibva kuJerusarema ichienda kuGaza.” Iyi inzira yomugwenga. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Iye adosumuka achienda. Adobva waona murume anokosha wokuItopiya, waiva muranda waKhandasi, zvinoreva kuti mambokadzi woItopiya. Murume iyeyo waiva muchengeti wopfuma yese yoItopiya, futi wanga waenda kuJerusarema konamata. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Pakudzoka kwache kumba wanga adogarikika mungoro yache achiverenga kuna muporofiti Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Mweya adoti kuna Firipi, “Nyedza papfupi nongoro urambe uri papfupi nayo.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Saka Firipi adomhanyira kungoro ndokumunzva murume uye achiverenga muporofiti Isaya. Firipi adomubvunza achiti, “Ko uri kunzvitsitsa chere zvauri kuverengazvo?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Iye adoti adoti kuna Firipi, “Anga ndinganzvitsitse tini pasinai anondirairira?” Saka adobva wakoka Firipi kuti akwire agare naye. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Zvino ndima yogwaro raanga achiverenga njiyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Sehwai rinoisiwa kumubai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">kana hwayana risingarire pamberi pomugeri warene, adonyarara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">haanai kushamisa muromo wache.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Pakuzvidziwa kwache, kururamisihwa adokurambihwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Mbani angatsanangure rudzi rache?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ndava upenyu hwache hunobisiwa panyika.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Muranda adoti kunaFiripi, “Ndinokumbirawo kuziva, mbani ari kurehwa nomuporofiti, ari kuzvireva chere kana kuti ari kureva umwewo?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Ipopo Firipi adothanga pagwaro rakareri ndokumuparidzira nyaya idonaka yaJesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Manje pavanga vachitekaira daro nonzira vadosvika panga pano mvura, muranda waKhandasi adoti, “Ona, mvura iri pano! Chiiko chinganditadzise kuombekewa?”<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Zvino Firipi adomuti, “Kana uchitenda nomwoyo wake wese, zvinoita kuti uwombekewe.” Zvino iye adopindura achiti, “Ndinotenda kuti Jesu Khirisitu ndiye mwanakomana waMwari.” <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Firipi adoraira kuti ngoro imisiwe, zvino vese vadopinda mumvura, Firipi ndokuombeka muranda. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Zvino vadoti vachibirika mumvura, Mweya waIshe udobvuta Firipi, muranda haanai kudzomuona pakamu, iye adotekaira hwendo hwache achifara. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Asi Firipi adowanika paAzoto, paaipinda waiparidza vhangeri pamaguta yese kusvikira wasvika kuKesariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Kupinduka kwaSauro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Mabasa yoNhumwa 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Asi Sauro achitutuma noukari adovhundutsa nokubaya vadzidzi vaIshe. Adoenda kumuphirisita mukuru, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />kokumbira matsamba yokuti aende kuDhamasiko kumasinagoge kuti kana akawana vanhurume kana vanhukadzi, voNzira yakarei, auye navo kuJerusarema vadosungiwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Zvino adoti watova papfupi noDhamasiko, kabodzi nokabodzi chiedza chidobva kudenga chidomutoya kumativi yese. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Uye adowira pasi, ndokunzva dzinga richiti kwaari, “Sauro, Sauro unonditambudzireiko?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Iye adoti, “Ndimi yaniko Ishe?” Iye adoti, “Ndini Jesu wauri kutambudza. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Asi sumuka uende muguta, uchanyepewa zvaunofanira kuita.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Varume vaanga anavo pahwendo, vadomira vasinai noromuromo rese, vachinzva dzinga asi vasingaone munhu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Zvino Sauro adosumuka kubva pasi, paadopenya, meso yache yanga yachaonaba, vadotomubata janja vachipinda naye muDhamasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Adoitirafuti mazuva matatu, asingaone, kana kuja kana kumwa mvura chaiyo. <verse eid="ACT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Zvino paDhamasiko panga pano mudzidzi waitiwa Ananiyasi. Ishe adoti kwaari nozvaadomunangidza muchiratidzo, “Ananiyasi!” Iye adoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">“Ndiri pano Ishe.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ishe adoti kwaari, “Sumuka uende munzira yomuguta inoitiwa Idorungama, ubvunze mumba maJudhasi munhu anoitiwa Sauro anobva kuThasasi, nokuti ari kunyengetera. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Naiyewo adoona murume anoitiwa Ananiyasi achipinda mumba achimuturika manja pamusoro wache kuti aone pakamu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Zvino Ananiyasi adopindura akati, “Ishe ndidonzva novanhu vadowanda nozvo murume wakareyu kuti adobata uyanga vatsvene venyu muJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Noipopano ano simba pakamu raadopasiwa novaphirisita vakuru kuti asunge vese vanonamata nozita renyu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Asi Ishe adoti kwaari, “Enda, nokuti murume wakareyu mudziyo wangu wandidosarudza kuti aende nozita rangu kuvanhu voyamwe Marudzi, madzimambo nokuvana vaIzirairi, <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />nokuti ndichamunangidza zvese zvaachafanira kutamburira nokuda kwozita rangu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ipopo Ananiyasi adobirika ndokuenda achibva wapinda mumba, adoturika manja pamusoro paSauro ndokuti, “Hama Sauro, Ishe Jesu, adozviratidza kwauri munzira yaudouya nayo, wandituma kuti udzotsehwe kuona kwako futi kuti uzaziwe naMweya Mutsvene.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ipopo mumaziso yache mudobirika tunenge tumabade, adothanga kuona pakamu, ndokusumuka achibva waombekewa.<verse eid="ACT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauro ano paridza muDhamasiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Adoja zvokuja ndokuwana simba. Adogara novadzidzi paDhamasiko mazuva yadotikuti. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ipopo adoparidzirafuti nozva Jesu mumasinagoge, kuti ndiye mwanakomana waMwari.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Vese vadozvinzva vadoshamisika vachiti, “Anga wakareyu ndiyeba waiparadza vaidana kuzita rakareri paJerusarema, adovinga zvakarezvo ikokuno, kuti aende navo vadosungiwa kuvapirisita vakuru?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Asi Sauro adoramba achiingidzika simba, adokunda vaJudha vanga vari paDhamasiko, achiratidza kuti Jesu ndiye Khirisitu.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Zvino mazuva mazinji payadopera, vaJudha vadorangana kuti vamubaye. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Asi kurangana kwavo kudozikana naSauro. Vadogaririra misuwo yese masikati nousiku, kuti vamubaye. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Manje vadzidzi vache vadomutora usiku, ndokumuvikha mudengu, vachimuburutsa nopamadziro.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauro muJerusarema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Zvino adoti wasvika kuJerusarema, adoedza kubatana novadzidzi, asi ivo vese vadomucha, vanga vasingatende kuti wava mudzidziwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Asi Bhanabhasi adomutora ndokuenda naye kunhumwa, ndokuvarondedzera maonero yaadoita Ishe, achibva wanyaira naye nomaparidziro yaadoita zita raJesu noushingi paDhamasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Saka Sauro adogara paJerusarema, achifambidzana navo, <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />adoparidza nozita raShe asingambocha. Adonyaira nokupikisana novaJudha vainyaira chiGiriki, asi ivo vadoedza kumubaya. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Zvino hama dzidoti dzazviziva, dzidomuendesa kuzasi kuKesariya, ndokumutumira kuThasasi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Zvino Kherekhe idova norunyararo paJudhiya rese, Gaririya, nopaSamariya. Kuburikidza naMweya Mutsvene kherekhe idosimbisiwa ichiingidzihwa muuwandu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ari muRidha nomuJopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Zvino Pita adoti achitenderera kwese, pakati pavo vese adosvikawo nokuvatsvene vanga vari kuRidha. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Adowana kwakareko munhu, waiitiwa Eniyasi, wanga adoenzera pabonde kwomakore masere, nokuda kwokuremara. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Pita adoti kwaari, “Eniyasi, Jesu Khirisitu anokuporesa, sumuka, uwarure bonde rako!” Ipopo adosumukirafuti. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Zvino vese vanga vachigara muRidha noSaroni vadomuona, vachibva vapindukira kuna Ishe.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Zvino paJopa panga pano mukadzi waiva mudzidzi, waiitiwa Tabhita, ndokuti Dhokasi, kana zvichisanduhwa. Iye wanga adozara nomabasa yadonaka nokupereka zvipo. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Zvino nomazuva yakareyo adohwara, ndokupfa. Vadoti vashambidza mutumbi wache, vadouisa muimba yokumusoro. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Zvino Ridha zvaranga riri papfupi nopapfupi noJopa, pavadonzva kuti Pita ari kwakareko, vadomutumira vanhu vairi kuti vamukumbire vachiti, “Tapota rekai kuchehwa kuuya kwatiri.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Ipopo Pita adosumuka, ndokuenda navo. Adoti wasvika, vadomuperekedza kuimba yokumusoro chirikadzi dzese dzidomira naye dzichirira, vadomunangidza majasi nohembe, zvidoitiwa naDhokasi, achiri navo. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Pita adovabiritsa panze vese, ndokupfugama achinamata, adochunungukira kumutumbi ndokuti, “Tabhita, muka!” Wanga adopfa adovhura meso yache, zvino paadoona Pita, adobva wagarikika. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Adomubata janja ndokumusumudza, adodaidza vatsvene nochirikadzi, ndokumuisa pamberi pavo ari mupenyu. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Zvidozikana novese paJopa, vazinji vadotenda kuna Ishe. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Ipopo adogara mazuva mazinji paJopa, kuno umwe musuki womatehwe waiitiwa Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Pita naKoniriyasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />PaKesariya, panga pano murume waiitiwa Koniriyasi, mukuru wozana romauto raizikana nokuti Hondo yoItariya, <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />murume wainamata nokucha Mwari, iye novoimba yache yese, waipasa vanhu zvipo zvizinji, nokunamata kuna Mwari nguwa dzese. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Zvino nonguwa inenge yopfemba yozuva adoonetsetsa muchiratidzo, ngirozi yaMwari ichipinda ichiti kwaari, “Koniriyasi!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Iye adoinangaritsa achicha, ndokuti, “Chiiko Ishe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Idoti kwaari, “Minamato yako nozvipo zvako zvakwira pamberi paMwari, zvayeukiwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Zvino chituma varume kuJopa, kodaidza Simoni, anoitiwa Pita, <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />ari kugara noumwe Simoni, musuki womatehwe, imba yache iri pagungwa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Zvino ngirozi, idonyaira naye, payanga yaenda, adodaidza varanda vache vairi nomuuto adorurama pakati povakarevo vaimushandira. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Wapedza kuvanyepa zvese, adovatuma kuJopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Zvino pazuva ridotevera, vachiri pahwendo vava papfupi noguta, Pita adokwira pamusoro poimba konamata nonguwa inenge yochitanhatu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Adonzva nzara, ndokuda kuwana chaangaje, asi chokuja pachanga chichibikiwa, adobatiwa nodatsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Adobva waona denga richizuruhwa, nochimwe chinhu chidoita kunge biza rikuru chidoburutsiwa pasi chidosungiwa mativi manai. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mukati marene manga munomhuka dzese dzinomakumbo manai nozvinosvova notushiri twokudzuru. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Izvi ridouya kwaari richiti, “Sumuka, Pita, baya uje.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Asi Pita adoti, “Neye Ishe, nokuti handinai kumboja chinhu chinotsambwa chisiri chitsvene.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Ipopo, izvi ridouya kamu kwaari kochipiri richiti, “Chidonatsiwa naMwari iwewe reka kumbochiti chinotsambwa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Zvakarezvo zvidoitika katatu, biza ridobva rakwidzihwirafuti kudenga.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Zvino Pita achiri kunetseka mukati mache kuti chiratidzo chaanga awona chairevei, varume vadotumiwa naKoniriyasi vanga vatosvika, vadotomira pasuwo vachibvunza kana paiva ipo pamba paSimoni, <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />vadodaidzira vachibvunza kana Simoni anoitiwa Pita wanga achigara pakarepo.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Zvino Pita achiri kufungitsitsa nozvochiratidzo chaadoona, Mweya adoti kwaari, “Ona, varume vatatu vari kukutsvaga. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Sumuka uburuke pasi, uende navo usingatsakidze, nokuti ndini ndavatuma.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Ipopo Pita adoburukira kuvarume vakarevo achiti, “Ndini wamuri kutsvaga, mauya nochikonzero chei?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ivo vadoti, “Koniriyasi, mukuru wozana romauto, murume adorurama uye noanocha Mwari, anotauhwa zvidonaka pamusoro pache norudzi rese rovaJudha, adoraihwa nongirozi itsvene kuti atume kwauri kuti uuye kumba kwache, kuti anzve zvauchanyaira.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Ipopo adovapinza mukati kuti vave varendo vache.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Nozuva ridotevera adosumuka achienda navo, uye dzimwe hama kubva kuJopa dzidoenda naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Pazuva ridodzotevera vadopinda muKesariya. Koniriyasi wanga adovatarisira pakamu wanga wadaidza hama dzache noshamwari dzache dzopapfupi. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Pita paadopinda, Koniriyasi adokumana naye ndokuwira pasi potsoka dzache achimunamata. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Asi Pita adomusumudza, achiti, “Sumuka, nainini ndiri munhuwo.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Zvino paanga achanyaira naye, adopinda mukati ndokuwana vanhu vadowanda vadoungana, <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />adoti kwavari, “Imimi munozviziva kuti hazvisi pamutemo kuti muJudha ajidzane kana kubvakachira munhu worimwe rudzi. Asi Mwari adondiratidza kuti handifaniri kumboti kumunhu upi zvache haanai kunaka kana kuti anotsambwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Saka pandidotumihwa, mutumi ndidouya ndisinai kupikisa, manje ndinoda kuziva ndipo chamandidaidzira.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koniriyasi adoti, “Mazuva manai yapfuura, nonguwa inenge yakareino, ndanga ndidochengeta nguwa yochipfemba yokunamata mumba mangu, nokamangu umwe murume adomira pamberi pangu adosimira hembe dzinoyetima, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />achiti, ‘Koniriyasi, munamato wako wanzvika nozvipo zvako zvarangarihwa pamberi paMwari. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tuma munhu kuJopa kodaidza Simoni anoitiwa Pita, ari kugara mumba maSimoni musuki womatehwe, panyasi pogungwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Saka ndidokutumirai mutumi nokamangu, maita zvidonaka zvamauya. Zvino isisu tese tiri pano pamberi paMwari, kuti tinzve zvese zvamaraihwa naIshe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyaira kwaPita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ipopo Pita adothanga kunyaira achiti, “Chokwadi ndinoona kuti Mwari anosaruraba munhu, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />asi parudzi ripi noripi munhu upi zvache anomucha, achiita zvidorurama anotambihwa naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Munoziva shoko raadotuma kuvaIzirairi, achiparidza nyaya dzidonaka dzorugare naJesu Khirisitu, ndiye Ishe wovese, <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />shoko ridoparidziwa muJudhiya rese, kuthanga muGaririya, mumasure moruombeko ridoparidziwa naJohwani, <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mwari mazodzero yaadoita Jesu woNazareta naMweya Mutsvene nosimba, nomatekairiro yaadoita achiita zvidonaka nokuporesa vese vanga vadotsikirihwa naJabhurosi, nokuti Mwari wanga anaye. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Uye isisu tiri pfakazi dzozvese zvaadoita munyika yovaJudha nomuJerusarema. Vadomubaya vachimuturika pamuti, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />asi Mwari adomumutsa nozuva rochitatu ndokumuita kuti aoneke, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />aikona kuvanhu vese asi kwatiri vadosarudziwa naMwari kuva pfakazi, tidoja nokumwa naye wabva mukumuka kuvadopfa. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Adotiraira kuti tiparidze kuvanhu, nokupfakaza kuti ndiye adogadziwa naMwari kuti ave mutongi wovapenyu novadopfa. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Vaporofiti vese vanopfakaza kuti wese anotenda maari anotambira kurekerehwa kwozvitema kuburikidza nozita rache.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Voyamwe Marudzi Vanotambira Mweya Mutsvene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Pita achiri kunyaira zvakarezvi, Mweya Mutsvene adoburuka pamusoro povese vadonzva shoko. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Zvino vatendi kubva pakati povadochecheudziwa vadouya naPita vadoshamisiwa, nokuti chipo choMweya Mutsvene changa chadururiwawo pamusoro poyamwe Marudzi. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Nokuti vadovanzva vachinyaira noimwe mitauro vachirumbidza Mwari. Ipopo Pita adoti, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Kuno munhu chere angarambidze mvura kuti vanhu vakareva vatambira Mweya Mutsvene kunge isisu vareke kuombekewa?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Zvino adovaraira kuti vaombekewe muzita raJesu Khirisitu. Ipopo vadomukumbira kuti ambogara navo kwomazuva mashoma.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Pita anozvidairira kuKherekhe yopaJerusarema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Zvino nhumwa nohama dzanga dziri paJudhiya vadonzva kuti voyamwe Marudzi vasiri vaJudha vadotambirawo shoko raMwari. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Zvino Pita paadoenda kuJerusarema, vatendi vokuchecheudziwa vadopikisana naye, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />vachiti, “Seiko iwewe udoenda kuvarume vasinai kuchecheudziwa uchija navo?” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Zvino Pita adothanga kuvatsanangurira mukuteedzana kwazvene.<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Ndanga ndiri muguta roJopa ndichinyengetera, ndidobatiwa datsi ndidoona chiratidzo, chimwe chinhu chidoburuka, chinenge biza rikuru, chichiburutsiwa kubva kudenga chino makona manai, chichibva chasvika kwandiri. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Pandidochinangaritsa ndidoona mhuka dzomakumbo manai nozvirombo zvomusango, nozvinosvova notushiri tokudzuru. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ndidonzva izvi richiti kwandiri, ‘Sumuka, Pita, baya uje.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Asi inini ndidoti, ‘Neye, Ishe, ndava hapanai chisinai kuchena kana chinotsambwa chidombopinda mukamwa mangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Asi izvi ridopindura kochipiri kubva kudenga richiti, ‘Chidonatsiwa naMwari, reka kumboti chinotsambwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Zvakarezvi zvidoitika katatu, zvichibva zvakwidziwa kudenga pakamu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Panguwa yakareyo varume vatatu vadosvika pamumba patanga tiri, vadotumiwa kwandiri kubva kuKesariya. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Zvino Mweya adondiudza kuti ndiende navo, ndisingaite rusaruro. Hama idzi dzitanhatu dzidoendawo neni, tikapinda mumba momurume wakareyu. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Iye achakunyepai maonero yaadoita ngirozi idomira mumba mache, ichiti, ‘Tumira kuJopa kodaidza Simoni, anoitiwa Pita, <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />iye achakunyairira shoko rauchaponesewa naro, iwewe noimba yako yese.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ndichindothanga kunyaira, Mweya Mutsvene adoburuka pamusoro pavo sezvaadoita patiri pakuthanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Zvino ndidoyeuka shoko raIshe, paadoti, ‘Johwani adoombeka nomvura, asi muchaombekewa naMweya Mutsvene.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Zvino kana Mwari adovapasawo chipo chibodzibodzicho chaadotipasa isisu patidotenda muna Ishe Jesu Khirisitu. Inini ndini yani kuti ndirambidze Mwari?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Pavadonzva zvakarezvo vadonyarara. Ndokukudza Mwari vachiti, “Saka Mwari adopasawo yamwe Marudzi kutendeukira kuupenyu.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kherekhe yopaAndiyoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Zvino avo vadopwamwadziwa nokuda kwokutambudziwa kudomuka pamusoro paSitefani, vadoenda kusvikira paFonisiya nokuSaipurasi noAndiyoki, vasinganyairire shoko vamwe kusiya kwovaJudha basi. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Asi padoita vamwe pakati pavo, varume vokuSaipurasi noSairini, vadoti vasvika muAndiyoki, vadonyairirawo vaGiriki, vachiparidza Ishe Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Uye Mwari adoenderera mberi achivabatsira, nokudaro vanhu vazinji vadotenda vachizviisa kuna Ishe.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Nyaya yakarei idosvika munzeve dzokherekhe yopaJerusarema, vachibva vatuma Bhanabhasi kuAndiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Iye paadosvika achiona mutsa waMwari, adofara, ndovakurudzira vese kuti varambe vadotendeka kuna Ishe nokuchinangwa chidosimba, <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />nokuti waiva murume adonaka, adozara naMweya Mutsvene nokutenda. Vazinji vadoingidzihwa kuna Ishe.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Zvino Bhanabhasi adoenda kuThasasi kotsvaga Sauro, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />uye paadomuwana, adouya naye kuAndiyoki. Kwogore rese vaiungana nokherekhe, vachidzidzisa vanhu vadowanda, uye paAndiyoki vadzidzi ndipo pavadothanga kudaidziwa kuti vaKhirisitu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Zvino pamazuva yakareyo vaporofiti vadouya kuAndiyoki vachibva kuJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Umwe wavo waiitiwa Agabhasi adosumuka ndokunyaira zvichauya kuburikidza naMweya Mutsvene kuti kuchauya nzara itsvuku pasi pese, uye izvozvo zvidoitika pamazuva yaKiraudhiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Ipopo vadzidzi vadomisikidza, kuti munhu wese paanokwanisa napo, atumire ruyamuro kuhama dzaigara kuJudhiya, <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />vadobva vaita zvakarezvo, ndokutumira zvipo zvavo kuvakuru kuburikidza naBhanabhasi naSauro.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Pfumvu Idosokoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Panguwa inenge yakareyo mambo Herudhe adosunga vamwe vanga vari vokherekhe achivatambudza. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Adobaya Jakobho, waiva mukoma nomunin'ina’ina naJohwani, nobakatwa, <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />zvino paadoona kuti zvidopfadza vaJudha, adoenderera mberi nokusunga Pita pakamu. Zvakarezvi zvidoitika pamazuva yomutambo woMazingwa yasinai Mbiriso. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Zvino paadomubata, adomuisa mutorongo, ndokumuisa kumapoka manai yovahwi, kuti vamuchengete, achida kuti mumasure moPhasika adzomuisa pamberi povanhu. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Saka Pita adochengetewa mutorongo, asi wanga achinyengeterehwa chaizvo noKherekhe kunaMwari.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Anosununguhwa kubva muTorongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Usiku hwakarehwo Herudhe hwaaida kumubiritsa, Pita wanga adoenzera pakati pomauto mairi, adosungiwa nongetani dziiri. uye vachengetedzi votorongo vanga vadogaririra pamusuwo. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Zvino nokamangu ngirozi yaIshe idooneka, chiedza ndokuvheneka mukamuri, ngirozi idorova Pita padivi ichimumutsa, ichiti, “Muka, nokamangu.” Zvino ngetani dzidombwera kubva mumanja yache. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Zvino ngirozi idoti kwaari, “Simira hembe dzako noshangu dzako.” Iye ndokuita zvakarezvo. Adoti kwaari, “Simira bhachi rako unditevere.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Adobirika, ndokumutevera, haanai kuziva kuti zvaiitiwa nongirozi nzvochaizvo, asi adofunga kuti wanga achiona chiratidzo. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Pavanga vapfuura muchengetedzi wokuthanga nowochipiri, vadosvika pasuwo rosimbi panopindiwa napo muguta, ridovavhurikira rega, vadobirika vachipinda munzira, pakarepo ngirozi idobva yamusiya.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Zvino Pita adochechuka, ndokuti, “Zvino ndino chokwadi kuti Ishe adotuma ngirozi yache kudzondipukunyutsa pajanja raHerudhe nopazvese zvaitarisihwa novanhu vochiJudha.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Paadoziva zvakarezvo, adoenda kumba kwaMariya, amai vaJohwani anoitiwa Mariko, kwanga kudoungana vanhu vazinji vachinyengetera. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Zvino paadogugudza pasasa, murandasikana waiitiwa Rodha adouya kudzodaira. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nokuziva dzinga raPita, haanai kuvhura sasa nokufara asi adomhanyira mukati konyairira vamwe kuti Pita adomira pamusuwo. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Ivo vadoti kwaari, “Unopenga.” Asi iye adosimbisa kuti ndizvo. Ivo vadoti, “Ingirozi yache!”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Asi Pita adoramba achigugudza, pavadodzovhura vadomuona vakashamisika. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Zvino iye adovaninira nojanja rache kuti vanyarare, adovatsanangurira mutoo Ishe waadomubiritsa nawo mutorongo. Adoti, “Nyepai Jakobho nodzimwe hama zvakarezvi.” Ipopo adobva wabirika ndokuenda kuimwe nzvimbo.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Zvino kudzoti zuva rabuda, padoitaba bongozozo ridiki pakati pomauto pamusoro pokuti chii changa chaitika kuna Pita. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Uye Herudhe paadomutsvaga achimusaya, adobvunzitsitsa vachengetedzi votorongo ndokuraira kuti vabaiwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Zvino adodzika achibva kuJudhiya kuenda kuKesariya ndokugara kwakareko.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupfa kwaHerudhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Zvino Herudhe adoitira ukari vanhu vokuThire novokuSidhoni, ivo ndokuuya kwaari vano pfungwa ibodzi, vabva kupenzveredza Bhurasitosi, mutariri woimba yamambo, vadokumbira rugare, nokuti nyika yavo yaipona nonyika yamambo pazvokuja.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Pazuva ridotahwa Herudhe adosimira hembe dzoumambo, ndokugarikika pamupando wache woushe, achinyaira kwavari. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Ipopo Vanhu vadodaidzira vachiti, “Rakareri izvi ramwari ranyaira aikona romunhu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Nokamangu ngirozi yaMwari idomuroverafuti pakarepo, nokuti haanai kupasa Mwari rukudzo, adojiwa nohonye ndokupfa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Asi shoko raMwari ridokura rikawanda.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Zvino Bhanabhasi naSauro, pavanga vapedza basa ravo vadodzoka kubva kuJerusarema, vachiuya naJohwani anoitiwa Mariko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Bhanabhasi naSauro VanoSarudziwa noKutumiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Zvino paKherekhe yopaAndiyoki panga pano vaporofiti novadzidzisi, vaiti, Bhanabhasi, Simiyoni, waiitiwa Naija, naRusiyasi wokuSairini, Manayeni iye wanga adorerewa pabodzi naHerudhe mutongi, naSauro. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Pavanga vachinamata Ishe, nokutsanya, Mweya Mutsvene adoti, “Ndisarudzirei Bhanabhasi naSauro kubasa randidovadaidzira.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Zvino mumasure mukutsanya nokunamata vadovaturika manja pamusoro ndokuvaendesa.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuSaipurasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Vatumiwa naMweya Mutsvene daro, vadoenda kuSerusiya, kubva pakarepo vadoenda kuSaipurasi nochikepe. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Pavadosvika paSarami, vadoparidza shoko raMwari mumasinagoge yovaJudha. Vanga vana Johwani anoitiwa Mariko achivabatsira.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Pavadopinda vadotekaira chitsuwa chese kusvikira vasvika paPamufosi, pakarepa vadokumana non'anga’anga, muJudha waiva muporofiti womabhwodo, waitiwa BhaJesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Wanga ari shamwari yomutongi wodunhu, waiitiwa Segiyasi Phaurosi, muzivitsitsi, iye adodaidza Bhanabhasi naSauro achitsvaga kunzva shoko raMwari. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Asi Erimasi n’anga ndava ndizvo zvinoreva zita rache adovarambidza, achitsvaga kubiritsa mutongi wodunhu kubva pakutenda. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Asi Sauro ndiyewo anoitiwa Phauro, adozara naMweya Mutsvene, adonangaritsa Erimasi n’anga <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />ndokuti, “Iwewe mwana waJabhurosi, iyewe muvengi wokururama kwese, udozara nounyengeri hwese nouipi, unomiraba nai kumonyorotsa nzira dzidoyoroka dzaIshe? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Zvino Nangara ndipo, janja raIshe rauya pamusoro pako, uchava bofu, uchaita nguwa usingaone chiedza chozuva.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Pakarepo pfurere norima zvidomuwira, adodzengerera kutsvaga anomutungamirira adomubata janja. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Zvino mutongi wodunhu paadoona zvidoitika, adotenda, nokuti adoshamisiwa nokudzidzisa pamusoro paIshe.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuAndiyoki yomuPisidhiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Zvino Phauro naabiyache, vadobva paPafosi nochikepe ndokusvika paPega muPamufiriya. Zvino Johwani waitiwa Mariko adovasiya ndokudzokera kuJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Asi ivo vadopfuurira mberi vachibva paPega ndokusvika paAndiyoki muPisidhiya. Zvino nomusi woSabata vadopinda musinagoge ndokugarikika pasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Mumasure mokuverengewa kudoitiwa kubva kumutemo waMozisi nozvinyohwa zvovaporofiti, vatungamiri vosinagoge vadotuma shoko kwavari vachiti, “Hama, kana muno shoko rokukurudzira vanhu, rinyairei.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Ipopo Phauro adosumuka, achininira nojanja rache adoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Varume vaIzirairi, naimimi voyamwe Marudzi muno namata Mwari, nditetekerei. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Mwari waivova vaIzirairi adosarudza madziteteguru yedu, ndokuvaita kuti vabudirire panguwa yavaigara muIjipiti, adovabiritsa kubva makaremo nojanja rinosimba. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Kwomakore yanoda kusvika makumi manai adovaitira mwoyo murefu musango. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Paadoparadza marudzi manomwe munyika yoKhenani, adovapasa nyika yavo senhaka. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Zvakarezvi zvese zvidotora makore yanoda kusvika mazana manai nomakumi mashano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Mumasure mozvakarezvo adovapasa vatongi kusvikira pamuporofiti Samueri. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ipopo vanhu vadokumbira kuti vave namambo, Mwari adovapasa Sauro mwanakomana waKishi, murume worudzi raBhenjamini, uyo adotonga kwomakore makumi manai. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Mumasure mokubiritsa kwaadoita Sauro, adomutsa Dhavhiti kuti ave mambo wavo, waadopfakazira achiti, ‘Muna Dhavhiti mwanakomana waJese ndawana murume anobva pamwoyo wangu, achaita kuda kwangu kwese.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kubva pavana vomurume wakareyu, Mwari adomutsira vaIzirairi Muponisi Jesu, sekuvimbisa kwaadoita. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Asinati wauya Johwani adoparidza kuvaIzirairi vese ruombeko kuno vanopinduka. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Zvino Johwani paanga waakupedza basa rache, adoti, ‘Munoti ndini yani? Ndiniba iye. Asi pano ari kuuya mumasure mangu, wandisinai kukodzera kusugudura murau woshangu dzache.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Hama, vana vomhuri yaAbhurahamu, novoyamwe Marudzi vanocha Mwari vari pakati penyu, shoko rakareri roruponiso ridotumihwa kwatiri. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Vanhu vanogara muJerusarema novatongi vavo, havanai kumuziva Jesu, asi pavadomutongera ipfa vadozazisa mashoko yovaporofiti yanoverengewa paSabata yegayega. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Kana zvavo vasinai kuwana kwaari murandu unokodzera kuti atongehwe ipfa, vadokumbira Pirato kuti abaiwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Zvino pavanga vazazisa zvese zvidonyohwa pamusoro pache, vadomuturunura pamuchinjikwa vakamuviga muguwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Asi Mwari adomumutsa kubva kuvadopfa, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />kwomazuva mazinji adozvinangidza kuno vaadotekaira navo kubva kuGaririya vachienda kuJerusarema. Ivova ndivo vava pfakazi dzache kuvanhu vedu vaIzirairi. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Tino kunyepai nyaya idonaka yokuti Mwari zvaadovimbisa madzibaba vedu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />adozvizazisa kwatiri isisu vana vavo nokumutsa kwaadoita Jesu. Sezvidonyohwa paPhisarema rochipiri kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Ndiwe mwanakomana wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">nasi ndakuzvara.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Mwari adomumutsa kubva kuvadopfa kuitira kuti areke kuora sekunyaira kwaadoita achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Ndichakupasa makomborero yochokwadi matsvene yadovimbisiwa Dhavhiti.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Saka zvidonyaihwawo pakamu pano rimwe Pisarema kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Munosiyaba Mutsvene wenyu achiona kuora.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Nokuti Dhavhiti, mumasure mokuzazisa chinangwa chaMwari pamazuva yache, adopfa, ndokuvigiwa pabodzi nomadzibaba yache, muviri wache udoora muguwa, <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />asi iyeyu adomutsiwa naMwari kubva kuvadopfa haanai kuona kuora. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Nokudaro hama dzangu, ndinoda kuti muzive, kuti kuburikidza nomurume wakareyu kurekerehwa kwozvitema kunoparidziwa kwamuri. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kuburikidza naye umwe noumwe anotenda, anosununguhwa kubva pazvivi zvese kururamisiwa kwamanga musingakwanise kuwana pasi pomutemo waMozisi. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Chenjerai ndipo, kuti zvidonyaihwa novaporofiti zvireke kuitika kwamuri.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Nangarai, imimi vashori, muno shamisiwa, muchiparara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ndava ndichaita zvinhu pamazuva yenyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">zvinhu zvamusingapfi matenda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">kana umwe munhu akatokunyairirai.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Phauro naBhanabhasi pavanga vaakubirika musinagoge, vanhu vadokumbira kuti zvinhu zvakarezvi vazvinyairihwe pakare paSabata raidzotevera. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Zvino ungano yosinagoge paidopera, vaJudha vazinji novanga vadopindukira kuchiJudha vadotevera Phauro naBhanabhasi, ivo vadonyaira kwavari vachivakurudzira kuti varambe vari pamutsa waMwari.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />PaSabata ridotevera padoita kunge guta rese raungana kudzonzva shoko raMwari. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Asi vaJudha pavadoona gurusvusvu rovanhu, vadozara nochanje, ndokupikisana nozvainyaihwa naPhauro vachimushora. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ipopo Phauro naBhanabhasi vadovapindura vadoshinga, vachiti, “Zvanga zvidokodzera kuti shoko raMwari rithange kunyairihwa imimi. Sezvo muri kurikuvira kudodaro uko kubva kwamuri, muchizviti munokodzeraba kuva noupenyu husingapere, taakuenda kuno voyamwe Marudzi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ndava izvozvo ndizvo zvatidoraihwa naIshe, achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Ndidokumisa kuti uve chiedza choyamwe Marudzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">kuti uendese ruponiso kumigumo yonyika.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Zvino voyamwe Marudzi pavadonzva zvakarezvo vadofara vachikudza shoko raMwari, futi vese vanga vadotarihwa upenyu husingapere vadotenda.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Shoko raIshe ridopararira kumatunhu yese. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Asi vatungamiri vovaJudha vadopesvera vakadzi vanoremekedzewa vanga vadozvipira pakunamata novarume vaitungamirira guta. Vadomutsira Phauro naBhanabhasi matambudziko, ndokuvadzingidza vachivabiritsa mudunhu ravo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Asi ivo vadovakuhumurira pfumbi rotsoka dzavo seyambiro kwavari, vachibva vaenda kuIkoniyamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Vadzidzi vadozara nomufaro naMweya Mutsvene.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">MuIkoniyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />PaIkoniyo vese vadopinda pabodzi musinagoge rovaJudha, vadotaura zvokuti vazinji vadotenda, vese vaJudha novaGiriki. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Asi vaJudha vanga vasingatende vadopandutsa pfungwa dzovaye voyamwe Marudzi kuti vamukire hama. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Nokudaro vadogara pakarepo nguwa irefu, vachinyaira zvaIshe vadoshinga, iye adopfakaza shoko romutsa wache, pakuvapasa kuita zviratidzo nozvishamiso nomanja yavo. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Asi vanhu vomuguta vadopesana: vamwe kudivi rovaJudha, vamwe kudivi ronhumwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Pakuedza kudoita voyamwe Marudzi novaJudha pabodzi novatungamiri vavo kuti vavabate uyanga nokuvataka nomabhwe, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />ivo vadozviziva ndokubva vatizira kuRisitira nokuDhebhe, maguta yoRikaoniya, nokunyika idopoteredza, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />vadoparidza vhangeri kwakareko.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuRisitira noDhebhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Zvino paRisitira panga padogarikika umwe murume, wanga asingakone kushandisa tsoka dzache; wanga ari mhetamakumbo kubva pakuzvahwa, wanga asinati wambotekaira. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Iye adotetekera Phauro achinyaira, naPhauro adomunangaritsa ndokuona kuti anokutenda kwokuti aporesewe, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />adoti nodzinga rino ruzha, “Sumuka umire notsoka dzako.” Iye panguwa yakareyo adochiruka ndokutekaira. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Mhomho paidoona zvidoitiwa naPhauro, vadodaidzira nomazvi yavo vachinyaira nochiRikaoniya vachiti, “Vamwari vaburuka kwatiri, vadoita kunge vanhu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Vadotenza Bhanabhasi kuti Zeyasi, naPhauro vadomutenza kuti Hemasi, nokuti ndiye waiva munyairi mukuru. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Zvino chimwari chaiitiwa Zeyasi changa chidovakhihwa imba kunze kwoguta, muphirisita wachene adouya nongunzi nomaruva pamusuwo woguta achida kubaira chibairo kuna Bhanabhasi naPhauro.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Asi nhumwa dzakaredzi, Bhanabhasi naPhauro pavadozvinzva, vadokerura hembe dzavo ndokumhanyira pakati pogurusvusvu vachidaidzira vachiti, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Varume, seiko muri kuita zvakarezvi? Tiri vanhuwo, vadoita kunge imimi, tiri kuuya kokupasai nyaya idonaka, yokuti mupindukire kuna Mwari mupenyu adoita denga nonyika nogungwa nozvese zviri makaremo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Panguwa dzidopfuura adotendera marudzi yese kutekaira nonzira dzavo, <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />asi haanai kureka kuzviisira pfakazi, ndava adoita zvidonaka pakukupasai mvura kubva kudenga, nomwaka yomagutwa, achigutsa mwoyo yenyu nozvokuja nomufaro.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Nomashoko yavo vadoshupika chaizvo kudzivisa vanhu kuvabaira chibairo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Asi vaJudha vadosvika kwakareko vachibva kuAndiyoki nokuIkoniyo, vadosukumidzira vanhu, ivo ndokutaka Phauro nomabhwe ndokumuzvuvira kunze kwoguta, vachiti wapfa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Asi vadzidzi pavadomukomba, adosumuka achidzokera muguta. Pazuva ridotevera iye naBhanabhasi vadoenda kuDhebhe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">KuDzokera kuAndiyoki iri muSiriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pavadoparidza vhangeri paguta rakarero, nokuita vadzidzi vadowanda, vadodzokera kuRisitira noIkoniyo nokuAndiyoki, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />vachisimbisa vadzidzi, nokuvakohomedza kuti varambire pakutenda, vachiti, tinofanira kupinda muushe hwaMwari nomatambudziko mazinji. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Vadoti vavasarudzira vatungamiri mukherekhe imwe noimwe, nokunyengetera nokutsanya, vadovaisa kuna Ishe wavadotenda.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Zvino vadopinda nomuPisidhiya, ndokusvika paPamufiriya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Vadoti vanyaira shoko paPhega, vadoenda kuAtariya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kubva pakarepo vadodzokera nochikepe kuAndiyoki, kwavanga vabva kuisiwa pamutsa waMwari nokuda kwobasa ravanga vazazisa.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Zvino pavadosvika, vadounganidza kherekhe pabodzi vachirondedzera zvese zvanga zvaitiwa naMwari kuburikidza navo, nomavhuriro yaadoita musuwo wokutenda kuno voyamwe Marudzi. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Uye vadogara novadzidzi pakarepo nguwa irefu.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">MuSangano paJerusarema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Asi vamwe varume vadouya kubva kuJudhiya vachidzidzisa hama vachiti, “Kunze kwokunge machecheudziwa notsika yaMozisi, munoponesewaba.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Zvino Phauro naBhanabhasi vadopesanaba pashoma navo, vachivapikisa, Phauro naBhanabhasi naabiyavo vadosarudziwa kuti vaende kuJerusarema koona nhumwa novakuru pamusoro pomubvunzo wakareyu.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Nokudaro pavadoendesewa noKherekhe, vadopinda nokwese kuFonisiya nokuSamariya, vachizivisa zvokupinduka kwovasiri vaJudha, uye vadopasa mufaro mukuru kuhama dzese. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Pavadosvika kuJerusarema, vadotambihwa nokherekhe nonhumwa novakuru, uye vadorondedzera zvese zvidoitiwa naMwari kuburikidza navo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Asi vamwe vaiva vatendi vobato rovaFarisi vadosumuka, vachiti, “Zvidokosha kuti vachecheudziwe nokuvaraira kuchengeta mutemo waMozisi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Nhumwa novakuru vadoungana pabodzi kuti vaise musoro pabodzi pamusoro ponyaya yakarei. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Zvino mumasure monharo dzikuru, Pita adosumuka ndokuti kwavari, “Hama dzangu, munoziva kuti kubvira pamazuva yokarekare Mwari adoita sarudzo pakati penyu, kuti nomuromo wangu vasiri vaJudha vanzve shoko rovhangeri vatende. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Uye Mwari iye anoziva mwoyo adonangidza kuti adovabvuma kuburikidza nokuvapasa Mweya Mutsvene sezvaadoitawo kwatiri. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Iye haanai kuisa musiyano pakati pedu naivo, asi adochenesa mwoyo yavo nokutenda. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Zvino munoedzereiko Mwari nokuisa pamutsipa wovadzidzi joki ranga risingakonewe kutakuriwa nomadzibaba yedu kana isisu? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Asi tinotenda kuti tichaponesewa nomutsa waIshe Jesu, sezvavachaita ivo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Ipopo ungano yese idoramba idonyarara; vachitetekera kuna Bhanabhasi naPhauro pavairondedzera zviratidzo nozvishamiso zvidoitiwa naMwari kuburikidza navo pakati povasiri vaJudha. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Pavadopedza kunyaira, Jakobho adopindura achiti, “Hama, tetekerai kwandiri. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simiyoni warondedzera mathangiro yadoita Mwari kubvakachira vasiri vaJudha, kuti atore kwavari vanhu vozita rache. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mashoko yovaporofiti yanobvumirana nozvakarezvi, semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Mumasure mozvakarezvi ndichadzoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">futi ndichavakha kamu imba yaDhavhiti, idowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">ndichasimudza maton’o yayene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">futi ndichaimutsa,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />kuti vadosara vovanhu vatsvage Ishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">novese vasiri vaJudha vanodaidziwa nozita rangu,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ndizvo zvinonyaira Ishe, adozivisa zvinhu zvakarezvi kubva kare kare.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Nokudaro inini ndinoti mbatirekei kutambudza yamwe marudzi vasiri vaJudha vanopindukira kunaMwari, <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />asi tivanyorere kuti vareke kuja zvidosvipisiwa kuburikidza nokubaihwa kuzvifananidzo vareke upombwe nokureka kuja nyama yochipfuwo kana mhuka idodzipiwa, kana nomusiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ndava murairo waMozisi udoparidziwa muguta kubva kare uye unoverengewa mumasinagoge Sabata regarega.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsamba Idonyorehwa Vatendi voyamwe Marudzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Zvino zvidonakira nhumwa, novakuru pabodzi nokherekhe yese, kusarudza varume pakati pavo vokutuma kuAndiyoki pabodzi naPhauro naBhanabhasi. Vadotuma Judhasi anoitiwa Bhasabhasi, naSairasi, vakuru pakati pohama, <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />notsamba inotevera, “Isisu, nhumwa pabodzi novakuru, kuhama dzoyamwe Marudzi vasiri vaJudha dziri paAndiyoki nopaSiriya, nopaSirisiya, moroi. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Sezvo tidonzva kuti vamwe vanhu vadobva kwatiri vadokunetsai nomashoko, kupishanisa pfungwa dzenyu, kana zvazvo tisinai kuvaraira zvakarezvo, <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />tidoona zvidonaka kwatiri, mumasure mokuisa pfungwa pabodzi, kusarura varume kuti tivatume kwamuri novadikani vedu Bhanabhasi naPhauro, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />varume vadoisa upenyu hwavo panjodzi nokuda kwaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Saka tatuma Judhasi naSairasi, ivo pachavo vachakunyepai nomuromo zvatiri kunyora. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Nokuti zvidooneka zvidonaka naMweya Mutsvene naisisu kuti tireke kuisa pamusoro penyu mutoro udokura unopfuura zvakarezvi zvidofanira, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />zvokuti mureke kuja zvidobaihwa kuzvifananidzo nomusiya, nozvidodzipiwa, nokureka upombwe. Kana mukazvichengeta kubva pazvakarezvi, munoita zvidonaka. Chisarai.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Zvino pavadotumiwa, vadoenda pasi kuAndiyoki, pavadounganidza ungano pabodzi, vadopereka tsamba. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ivo pavadoriverenga, vadofara nokusimbisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Zvino Judhasi naSairasi, vanga vari vaporofiti pachavo, vadokurudzira hama nomashoko mazinji nokuvasimbisa. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Vadoti vapedza nguwa irefu, hama dzidodzovadzotsera norugare kuno vadovatuma. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Zvidodaipo, Sairasi adoona zvidomunakira kusara pakarepo.<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Asi Phauro naBhanabhasi vadoramba vari paAndiyoki, vachidzidzisa nokuparidza shoko raIshe, novamwe vazinjifutivo.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro naBhanabhasi vano Paradzana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ipopo mumasure momazuva yadotikuti Phauro adoti kuna Bhanabhasi, “Mbatidzoke tino bvakachira hama mumaguta yese yatidoparidza shoko raIshe, tinoona kuti vari tini.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Zvino Bhanabhasi waida kutorawo Johwani waiitiwa Mariko. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Asi Phauro adofunga kuti zvidonaka kureka kuenda naye iye adovasiya paPamufiriya, achireka kuenda navo kubasa. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ipopo padova nokupesana kukuru, zvokuti vadotopararana, Bhanabhasi adotora Mariko ndokuenda kuSaipurasi nochikepe, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />asi Phauro adosarudza Sairasi, ndokuenda, wareverehwa nohama kumutsa waIshe, <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />adopfuura nokuSiriya nokuSirisiya, achisimbisa makherekhe.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti Anoenda pabodzi naPhauro naSairasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Adosvikawo paDhebhe nopaRisitira. Mudzidzi wanga ari pakarepo, waiitiwa Timoti, mwanakomana womukadzi muJudha wanga ari mutendi, asi baba vache vaiva muGiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Iye waipfakazihwa zvidonaka nohama dzopaRisitira nopaIkoniyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Phauro waida kuenda naTimoti, saka adomutora ndokumuchecheudza nokuda kwovaJudha vanga vari kunzvimbo dzakaredzo, ndava vese vaizviziva kuti baba vache vaiva muGiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Zvino vadoenda hwendo hwavo vachipinda nomumaguta, vachivapasa dzidziso dzokuti vachengete mirau yanga yaitiwa nonhumwa novakuru vaiva kuJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Nokudaro kherekhe dzidosimbisiwa pakutenda, futi dzidoingidzika pakuwanda kwovanhu zuva rimwe norimwe.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiratidzo chaPhauro muThiroasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Vadopinda nomumatunhu yoFirigiya noGaratiya, vabva kurambidziwa naMweya Mutsvene kunyaira shoko paEzhiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Zvino pavadosvika padonangarana noMizhiya, vadoedza kupinda muBhitiniya, asi Mweya waJesu haunai kuvabvumidza. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Vapfuura paMizhiya, vadosvika kuTiroasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Zvino chiratidzo chidoonewa naPhauro usiku, murume wokuMakedhoniya wanga adomira achimukumbira achiti, “Yambukiraiwo kuno kuMakedhoniya mutibatsire.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Zvino paadoona chiratidzo, tidotsvaga nokamangu kuenda Makedhoniya tichiti, Mwari watidaidza kovaparidzira vhangeri.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">KuPinduka kwaRudhiya paFiripi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Tichisumuka kubva paTiroasi nochikepe, tidonanga kuSamoturasi, mangwana yacho tidosvika paNeyapori, <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />kubva pakarepo tidoenda kuFiripi, rinova guta rikuru rodunhu roMakedhoniya, riri pasi poRoma. Tidogara muguta rakarero kwomazuva, <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />pazuva roSabata tidobirika kunze kwosuwo rikuru kuhwizi, kwataiti kuno nzvimbo yokunamatira, zvino tidogara pasi tichinyaira kuvakadzi vanga vaungana pabodzi. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Umwe adotinzva wanga ari mukadzi waiitiwa Rudhiya, waibva muguta roTiyatira, mutengesi womachira yadotsvukuruka, wanga ari munamati waMwari. Ishe vadovhura mwoyo wache kuti anzve zvainyaihwa naPhauro. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Paadoombekewa, iye novoimba yache, adotikumbira achiti, “Kana maona ndidotendeka kuna Ishe, uyai kumba kwangu mugare.” Uye adotipenzverera.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuTorongo paFiripi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Zvino pataienda panzvimbo yokunamatira, tidosangana nomuranda wochisikana wanga ano mweya wosvikiro, waiwanisa atenzi vache mari izinji nokuwombeza kwache. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Iye adotevera Phauro naisisu, achidaidzira achiti, “Varume vakareva varanda vaMwari Wokumusorosoro, vanokuparidzirai nzira yoruponiso.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Adoita zvakarezvo mazuva mazinji. Zvino Phauro adosemburiwa nazvo, ndokubva wachungunuka achiti kumweya, “Ndinokuraira muzita raJesu Khirisitu kuti ubirike maari.” Udobirikirafuti nonguwa yakareyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Zvino varidzi vache vadoti vachiona kuti tariro yokunota kwavo yaenda, vadobata Phauro naSairasi, vachivazvuvira kudare pamberi povatongi, <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />pavadovaendesa kuvatongi, vadoti, “Vanhu vakareva vaJudha uye vari kukanganisa guta redu, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />vanotiparidzira tsika dzatisingabvumihwe isisu vaRoma kuti tidzitambire, kana kudzitevera.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Zvino mhomho idopindira pakuvahwisa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">uye vakuru vovatongi vadovakerurira hembe, ndokuraira kuti vabutiwe notsvimbo. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Zvino pavadovashapura zvidokungudza, vadovakhanda mutorongo, ndokuraira muchengeti wotorongo kuti avachengetetse. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Waraihwa, adovaisa mutorongo romukatikati, adosungirira makumbo yavo pamatanda.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Asi panenge pakati pousiku Phauro naSairasi vainamata nokuimbira Mwari zvimbo, uye vamwe vasungwa vanga vachivatetekera. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Kabodzi nokabodzi padova nokugwetedzeka kwonyika kukuru, zvokuti nheyo dzotorongo dzidozunguzika, pakarepo misuwo yese idovhurika uye misungo yomunhu wese idopfudzunuka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Zvino muchengeti wotorongo paadopepuka ndokuona misuwo yotorongo idovhurika, adovhomora bakatwa rache achida kuzvibaya, achifunga kuti vasungwa vatsvudumuka. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Asi Phauro adodaidzira nodzinga ropamusoro achiti, “Reka zvako kuzvikuwadza. Tiripo tese!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Ipopo adodaidzira moto ndokumhanyira makaremo, achitetemera nokucha adowira pasi pamberi paPhauro naSairasi, <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />adovabiritsa kunze ndokuti, “Varume, chii chandinofanira kuita kuti ndiponesewe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Ivo vadoti, “Tenda muna Ishe Jesu, uchaponesewa, iwewe novoimba yako.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Vadonyaira shoko raIshe kwaari novese vanga vari mumba mache. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Adovatora nonguwa yakareyo yousiku, ndokusuka zvironda zvavo, achibva waombekehwerafuti pakarepo, iye nomhuri yache yese. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Paadoenda navo mumba mache, adovapasa zvokuja, adofara novoimba yache vese kuti, wanga watenda muna Mwari.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Asi pakudochena, vatongi vomhosva vadotuma mapurisa, vachiti, “Biritsai vanhu vaye.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Muchengeti wotorongo adonyepa Phauro mashoko iyoyo, achiti, “Vatongi vatumira shoko rokuti mubiritsiwe, saka zvino birikai muende norugare.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Asi Phauro adoti kwavari, “Vadotirova paruzinji, tisinai kutongewa isisu tiri nzvahwa dzokuRoma, vachitotiisa mutorongo, zvino vaakutibiritsa kabisira? Neye! Mbavauye ivo vatibiritse.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Mapurisa yadonyepa vatongi mashoko yakareya, ivo vadocha pavadonzva kuti vanga vari nzvahwa dzokuRoma, <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />saka vadouya vachikumbira ruregerero kwavari. Zvino vadovabiritsa ndokuvakumbira kuti vabirike muguta. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Saka vadobirika mutorongo, ndokubvakachira Rudhiya, vadoti vaona hama, vadovakurudzira vachibva vaenda.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">MuThesaronika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Zvino Phauro naabiyache pavadodarika nopaAmufiporisi noAporoniya, vadosvika paThesaronika, panga pano sinagoge rovaJudha. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Zvino Phauro adopinda mukati setsika yache, uye kwomasondo matatu adopikisana navo kubva mumagwaro, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />achitsanangura nokuratidza kuti zvanga zvidokodzera kuti Khirisitu atambudzike nokumuka kuvadopfa, achiti, “Jesu wakareyu, wandinokuparidzirai, ndiye Khirisitu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Vamwe vavo vadokurudzirika, ndokubatana naPhauro naSairasi, ndizvo zvidoitiwa novanamati vazinji vochiGiriki novanhukadzi vairemekedzewa aikona vashoma.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Asi vaJudha vanga vano chanje, vadotora varume vadoipa, mhandu, vadounganidza mhomho yovanhu, ndokumutsa bongozozo muguta, vachihwisa imba yaJasoni, vachida kuvabiritsira kuvanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Pavadovasaya, vadozvuvira Jasoni nodzimwe hama pamberi povakuru voguta, vachidaidzira vachiti, “Varume vakareva vadosunamisa nyika vadosvikawo kuno, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Jasoni adovatambira, vese vari kuita zvinopesana nozvirevo zvaKesari, vachiti, panoumwe mambo, Jesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Vanhu pabodzi novakuru voguta, vadokanganisiwa pavadonzva zvakarezvo. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Zvino pavadotora chibatiso kuna Jasoni novamwe, vadovasiya vachienda.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuBheriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Nokamangu hama dzidoendesa Phauro naSairasi kuBheriya nousiku, ivo pavadosvika vadopinda musinagoge rovaJudha. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Zvino vaJudha vakareva vanga vadonaka kukunda vokuThesaronika, ndava vadotambira shoko nomwoyo unochido, vachinzvera magwaro zuva rimwe norimwe, kuti vaone kana zvinhu zvakarezvo zviri izvo. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Nokudaro vazinji vavo vadotenda, zvichisanganisira varume novakadzi vaikudziwa vaiva vaGiriki vanga vadowanditsa. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Asi vaJudha vokuThesaronika pavadozviziva kuti shoko raMwari raiparidziwa naPhauro nopaBheriyawo, vadouyawo ipopo, vachibvundurira nokunyonganisa mhomho. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ipopo hama nokamangu dzidoendesa Phauro nokugungwa, asi Sairasi naTimoti vadosara pakarepo. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Avo vadoperekedza Phauro vadomusvitsa kuAtene, vadoti vatambira rairo yokuudza Sairasi naTimoti kuti vakurumidze kuuya kwaari, vadobirika vachienda.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuAtene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Zvino Phauro paanga adovamirira paAtene, adosorewa mumweya wache paadoona kuti guta ranga ridozara nozvifananidzo. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Nokudaro adopikisana novaJudha, novanamati, novamwe vaaikumana navo musinagoge, nopamusika zuva rimwe norimwe. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Vamwe vafungitsitsi vovaEpikurini novaSitoiki vadosangana naye. Vamwe vadoti, “Chiiko chinonyaihwa nomuwawati wakareyu?” Vamwe vadoti, “Anenge muparidzi wanamwari vasingazikane” ndava adoparidza Jesu norumuko. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ipopo vadomubata, ndokumuisa paAreyopago, vachiti, “Tinoda kuziva kuti nghupi kudzidzisa kutsva uku kwaunoreva? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Nokuti uri kuuya nozvinhu zvitsva panzeve dzedu; saka tinoda kuziva kuti zvinhu zvakarezvi zvinorevei?” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Zvino vanhu vokuAtene vese, novatohwa vaigara makaremo, hapanai chavaipedzera nguwa kunze kwokunyaira kana kunzva chinhu chitsva.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Zvino Phauro, adomira pakati poAreyopago, adoti, “Varume voAtene, ndinoona kuti pazvinhu zvese muri vanamati chaizvo. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Nokuti pandaipfuura, ndidowanawo atari ino munembo uyu, ‘Kuna mwari asingazikane.’ Zvino chamunonamata musingachizivi, ndicho chandinokuparidzirai. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Mwari adoita nyika nozvese zviri mairi, ari Ishe wodenga nonyika, haagari muzvivakwa zvidogadzihwa novanhu, <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />haashumihwe nomanja yovanhu, kunge ano chinhu chaanosaya, sezvo ari iye anopasa vanhu vese upenyu nokufema nozvese, <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />iye adoita marudzi yese yovanhu yachibva pamunhu mubodzi kuti vagare panyika pese, wambotara nguwa nomigano yougaro hwavo, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />kuti vatsvage Mwari, notariro yokuti vamutsvatsvadzire, vamuwane. Kana nepo asiri kurefu noumwe noumwe wedu. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Nokuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Maari tinorarama nokufamba nokuva zvatiri,’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:28">sezvidoreva vamwe vadetembi venyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Nokuti tiri vorudzi rache.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Zvatiri rudzi raMwari, hatifaniri kufunga kuti hu Mwari hudofanana nondarama, kana sirivha, kana ribwe, zvidovezewa noumasiri nokufunga kwomunhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Mwari adoreka zvache kuyeuka nguwa dzokusaya zivo, asi zvino anoraira vanhu vese kwesekwese kuti vapinduke, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />nokuti adotara zuva, raachatonga nyika naro nokururama, nomurume waadomisikidza, zvakarezvi adozvisimbisa kuvanhu vese nokumumutsa kubva kuvadopfa.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Zvino pavadonzva zvokumuka kovadopfa, vamwe vadoseka, asi vamwe vadoti, “Tichadzokunzva pakamu pamusoro pozvakarezvi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Nokudaro Phauro adobirika pakati pavo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Asi vamwe varume vadobatana naye pakutenda, pakati pavo paiva naDhiyonisiyasi, muAreyopago, nomukadzi wainzi Dhamari, novamwe pabodzi navo.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">MuKorinde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvo, Phauro adobva paAtene achienda kuKorinde. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Adowana muJudha, waiitiwa Akwira, nzvahwa yokuPondasi, achandobva kuItari, naPurisira mukadzi wache, nokuti Khiraudhiyasi wanga waraira kuti vaJudha vese vabirike muRoma. Saka adoenda kovaona, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />zvino nokuti wanga ari wobasa ribodzi navo adogara navo, vachishanda, ndava basa ravo ranga riri rokugadzira matende. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Sabata regarega adokurukurirana navo musinagoge, achikohomedza vaJudha novaGiriki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sairasi naTimoti pavadosvika vachibva kuMakedhoniya, Phauro wanga adobatikana nokuparidza, achipupurira vaJudha kuti Jesu ndiye Khirisitu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Zvino pavadomupikisa nokumushora, adokuhumura hembe dzache adoti kwavari, “Gazi renyu mbarive pamisoro yenyu! inini handinai mhosva. Kubva iyezvino ndichaenda kuno vasiri vaJudha.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Adobirika pakarepo achienda kumba kwaTito Jusito, anonamata Mwari, imba yache yanga iri papfupi nosinagoge. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Khirisipasi mukuru wosinagoge, adotenda muna Ishe, pabodzi novoimba yache vese; novaKorinde vazinji vadonzva ndokutenda vadoombekewa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Zvino pano humwe usiku Ishe adonyaira kuna Phauro muchiratidzo achiti, “Reka kucha, nyaira, reka kunyarara, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />ndava ndinewe, hapanai munhu achakuhwisa kuti akukuwadze, ndava ndinovanhu vazinji muguta rakarerino.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Saka iye adogara gore nomwedzi mitanhatu, achidzidzisa shoko raMwari pakati pavo.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Asi Gariyo paadova mukuru woAkaya, vaJudha vadobatana kuhwisa Phauro vachimuendesa kudare romhosva, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />vachiti, “Murume wakareyu ari kukurudzira vanhu kunamata Mwari zvinopesana nomutemo.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Asi Phauro paanga waakuda kunyaira, Gariyo adoti kuvaJudha, “Dai iri nyaya yokudzonga kana mhosva ikuru, ndingadai ndino chikonzero chokuita mwoyo murefu naimipa, vaJudha, <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />asi sezvo iri nyaya yomibvunzo yomashoko nomazita nomutemo wenyu, zvionerei mega, inini ndinoramba kuva mutongi wozvinhu zvakarezvo.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Adovabiritsa mudare. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Zvino vese vadobata Sositeni, mukuru wosinagoge, ndokumurova pamberi podare. Asi Gariyo haanai kuita basa nazvo.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">KuDzokera kuAndiyoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi Phauro adogara pakarepo mazuva mazinji. Adodzobva pahama, achibva waenda kuSiriya nochikepe, ana Akwira naPurisira, paKenikiriya adogusiwa bvudzi mumusoro wache ndava wanga ano mhiko. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Zvino vadosvika paEfeso, iye ndokuvasiya pakarepo, asi iye pachake adopinda musinagoge ndokupikisana novaJudha. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Pavadomukumbira kugara nguwa irefu, haanai kubvuma; <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />asi achigonekana navo adoti, “Ndichadzoka kwamuri kana Mwari achida,” ndokubirika paEfeso nochikepe.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Paadosvika paKesariya, adoenda komoresa kherekhe, ndokudzoenda kuAndiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Pamasure pokutora nguwa ari pakarepo adobirika, achienda kunzvimbo nonzvimbo mumatunhu yoGaratiya noFirigiya, achisimbisa vadzidzi vese.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aporo muEfeso nomuKorinde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Zvino muJudha waiitiwa Aporo, nzvahwa yokuArekizandiriya, adouya kuEfeso. Wanga ari murume anokona kunyaira, waiziva magwaro chaizvo. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Wanga adorovedzehwa munzira yaIshe, futi achipisa pamweya, adonyaira nokunatsa kudzidzisa nozvaJesu, kunyange zvazvo waindoziva ruombeko raJohwani basi. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Iye adothanga kunyaira asingache musinagoge, asi Purisira naAkwira pavadomunzva, vadomutora ndokumutsangurira nzira yaMwari zvidozara. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Adoti achida kuyambukira kuAkaya hama dzidomukurudzira, dzichinyorera kuvadzidzi kuti vamutambire. Paadosvika, adobatsira zvikuru ivo vanga vatenda kuburikidza nomutsa waMwari, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ndava nosimba adokunda vaJudha pachena, achinangidza noMagwaro kuti Jesu ndiye Khirisitu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Phauro ari muEfeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Zvino Aporo paanga ari muKorinde, Phauro adopinda nomunyika dzokumusoro ndokuuya kuEfeso. Kwakareko adowana vamwe vadzidzi, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />adoti kwavari, “Mudotambira Mweya Mutsvene chere pamudopinduka?” Ivo vadoti kwaari, “Neye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">hatinai kana kumbonzva kuti Mweya Mutsvene aripo.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Adoti kwavari, “Ko mudoombekewa muruombeko ripi?” Ivo vadoti, “Noruombeko raJohwani.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Phauro adovati, “Johwani adoombeka noruombeko rokupinduka, achiudza vanhu kuti vatende kumubodzi Jesu waidzouya, mumasure mache.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Pavadonzva zvakarezvo, vadoombekewa muzita raIshe Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Zvino Phauro paadoturika manja yache pamusoro pavo, Mweya Mutsvene adouya pavari, ndokubva vanyaira nondimi vachiporofita. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Vese pabodzi vanga vachitosvika gumi novairi.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Phauro adopinda musinagoge kwomwedzi mitatu ndokunyaira adoshinga, achiteterera nokukurudzira zvoumambo hwaMwari, <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Asi vamwe pavadoomesa mwoyo vasingatende, vachinyaira zvidoipa pamusoro poNzira pamberi poungano, adobirika kubva kwavari, achitora vadzidzi, nokupikisana mazuva yese muimba yochikoro chaTairanasi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Zvakarezvi zvidoenderera pamberi kwomakore mairi, zvichiita kuti vese vagari vomuEzhiya, vaJudha novaGiriki vanzve shoko raIshe.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vaSikevha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Mwari adoita zvinoshamisa zvidotsarukana nomanja yaPhauro, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />zvokutoti biza kana jira zvaitohwa kubva pamuviri wache kuendesewa kuvahwere, matenda yaibirika kwavari uye mweya idoipa idobirika kwavari. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Zvino vamwe vaJudha vaimbodzinga mweya idoipa, vadothanga kuzviita kuvanhu vaiva nomweya idoipa vachishandisa zita raShe Jesu, vachiti, “Ndinokudzingai muzita raJesu anoparidziwa naPhauro.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Vanakomana vanomwe vomuphirisita mukuru wochiJudha waiitiwa Sikevha vanga vachiita zvakarezvi.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Asi mweya udoipa udovapindura uchiti, “Jesu ndinomuziva, naPhauro ndinomuziva, asi imipa ndimi anaani?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Zvino munhu wanga anomweya udoipa adovakachikira, ndokuvakurira pamasimba vese, nokudaro vadodzotiza mumbamo vaapedzi uye vakuwadziwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Zvakarezvi zvidozikana novagari vese vomuEfeso, vaJudha pabodzi novoyamwe Marudzi, vadobva vachisiwa nazvo vese, zita raIshe Jesu ridobva rakudziwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Uye vazinji vovanga vatenda vadouya, vachireurira nokubiritsa pachenu mabasa yavo. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Uye vazinji vavo vaiita zvomushonga vadouya nomabhuku yavo ndokuyaunganidza vachiyapisa pamberi povanhu vese, uye vadoverenga mutengo wayene ndokuona kuti waisvika masirivha zviuru makumi mashano. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Saka shoko raIshe ridokura ndokuva nochikuriri zvidosimba.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bongozozo muEfeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi, Phauro adofunga mumwoyo mache kupinda nomuMakedhoniya nomuAkaya pakuenda kuJerusarema, achiti, “Kana ndabva kwakareko, ndichanoonawo Roma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Nokudaro paadotuma vabatsiri vache vairi, Timoti naErasito, kuti vaende kuMakedhoniya, iye pachake adombogara muEzhiya kwokanguwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Panguwa yakareyo bongozozo rikuru ridomuka pamusoro poNzira. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Ndava mupfuri wosirivha waiitiwa Dhemetiriyasi, waigadzira dzimba dzosirivha dzokunamatira Atemisi, waiuyisa maronda yadowanditsa kunanamasiri. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Vakarevo adovaunganidza pabodzi nabiyavo vaiita zvibodzibodzizvo ndokuti, “Varume, munoziva kuti kubva pabasa rakareri tinowana upfumi. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Zvino munoona nokunzva kuti hamusi muEfeso mega asi munenge muEzhiya yese Phauro wakareyu wafurira nokukwezva chikwata chikuru chovanhu, achiti zvimwari zvidogadzihwa nomanja hazvizi vamwari. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Zvino pava nongozi isiri yobasa redu chete kuti richapfuruka asiwo noimba yamwarikadzi mukuru Atemisi ichaitiwa chinhu chisinai basa, uye kuti achabiritsiwa paukuru hwache, iye anonamatiwa muEzhiya mese nopasi pese.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Zvino pavadonzva zvakarezvi vadokaripa, ndokudaidzira vachiti, “Atemisi wovaEfeso mukuru!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Saka guta rese ridoita bongozozo; ndokubva vamhanyira kunhandare, vachizvuva Gaiyasi naArisitakasi, vokuMasedhoniya vanga vari vaperekedzi vaPhauro pahwendo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Phauro waida kupinda mukati mogurusvusvu, asi vadzidzi havanai kumubvumidza. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Vamwe vaiva vatungamiriri dziri shamwari dzache, vadotumira shoko kwaari vachimukumbiritsa kuti areke kupinda munounganihwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Zvino vamwe vaidaidzira chinhu chibodzi, vamwe chimwewo, ndava ungano yakareyo yanga inonyongano, vazinji vavo vanga vasingazive zvavadounganira. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Vamwe mugurusvusvu vadonenedzera Arekizanda, ndava vaJudha vanga vamutungamidza pamberi. Saka Arekizanda adosumudza ruoko achida kuzvidzivirira kuvanhu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Asi pavadoziva kuti wanga ari muJudha, vese vadodaidzira noizvi ribodzi kwomaawa yaitosvika mairi vachiti, “Atemisi wovaEfeso mukuru!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Zvino munyori woguta paadodzonyaradza chaunga adoti, “Varume voEfeso, ngupi munhu asingazive kuti guta rovaEfeso ndiro muchengeti woimba yaAtemisi mukuru, nodombo rinoera ridombwera kubva kudenga? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Zvamuri kuona kuti hapanai anopokana nozvakarezvi, saka munofanira kudzikama morega kuita zvinhu muchipaparika. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ndava mauya pano novarume vakareva vasiri mbavha dzoimba yaMwari kana vashori vamwarikadzi wedu. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Zvino kana Dhemetiriyasi naabiyache vanomurandu nomunhu, matare yadovhuriwa, futi vanotonga varipo, mbavamhangarirane. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Asi kana muchitsvaga mimwe mirandu pamusoro ponyaya yakarei, mbazvitauriwe paungano idokodzera. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Nokuti taakuva nomurandu wokuitika kwobongozozo ranasi, ipo pasinai chikonzero chatinopa kuti munyonga waitihwei.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Paadonyaira zvakarezvi, adopamwadza ungano.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">KuMakedhoniya noAkaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Bongozozo paridopera, Phauro adodaidza vadzidzi, paadovasimbisa adovagoneka ndokuenda kuMakedhoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Paadoenda nomunzvimbo dzakaredzi achishingisa vatendi zvidonyanya, adosvika kuGirisi. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Pakarepo adogara mwedzi mitatu, uye maJudha pavadodzomurangana iye waitogadzirira kuenda nochikepe kuSiriya, achida kudzodzoka nokuMakedhoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopata nzvahwa yokuBhereya, mwanakomana waPairasi adomuperekedza, uye vokuThesaronika ndiArisitakasi naSekundasi, naGaiyasi naTimoti vokuDhebhe; novokuEzhiya Tikikasi naTirofimasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Ivova vadotungamira kuenda vachidzotimirira paTiroasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Asi tidokhwasva kubva paFiripi mumasure momazuva yoMazingwa Yasinai Mbiriso, uye mumazuva mashano tidosvika paTiroasi, ndipo patidogara mazuva manomwe.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubvakacha kwokupedzisira kwaPhauro paTiroasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Zvino nomusi wokuthanga kwosondo, patidoungana pabodzi kuti timepfure mazingwa, Phauro adotaura kwavari, achida kudzoenda mangwanachimuka. Adopindiridza kunyaira kwache kusvika pakati pousiku. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Muimba yopamusoro matanga tidoungana manga muno moto mizinji. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Uye mujaha waiitiwa Yutiko wanga adogarikika pafafitera. Adobatiwa nohope dzidokungudza Phauro achiri kunyaira nguwa irefu, paadokundiwa nohope, adokoromoka kubva paimba yochitatu ndokuhwengewa wapfa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Asi Phauro adoburuka ndokukotamira paari, adomuzvembetera ndokuti, “Rekai kutambudzika upenyu hwache huchiripo!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Uye Phauro paadokwira adokomora mazingwa ndokuja, adoita hurukuro navo nguwa irefu, kusvika zuva rabirika, ndopaadozobirika kuenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Vadotora mujaya ndokuenda naye ari mupenyu, vadonyaradziwa chaizvo.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubva paTiroasi kusvika kuMeritasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Asi pakutungamira kuenda kuchikepe, tidokwasva kuenda kuAsosi, tichida kutora Phauro kwakareko kuti apinde, nokuti ndozvaanga waronga, paaida pachake kuenda nopanyika. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Paadosangana naisisu paAsosi, tidomutora muchikepe ndokusvika kuMitairini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Patidokhwapa kubva pakarepo tidosvika padonangarana noKhiyosi zuva raitevera, pazuva rimwe raizotevera tidosvika paSamosi, uye pazuva ridotevera rakarero tidosvika kuMeritasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Nokuti Phauro wanga wasarudza kupinda nokuEfeso, kuti areke kupedza nguwa ari muEzhiya, ndava wanga achiita kamangu kuti ave kuJerusarema, kana zvichikoneka pazuva roPendekositi.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro Anotsindikira Vakuru vokuEfeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Zvino ari paMeritasi adotumira kuEfeso, kuti vakuru vokherekhe vauye kwaari. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Saka pavadouya kwaari, adoti kwavari, “Imimi pachenyu munoziva mugariro wandidoita pakati penyu nguwa dzese, kubva pazuva randidosvika muEzhiya, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Ndichishumira Ishe nokuzvidikipisa kwese uye nomisodzi nomiedzo idondiwira kuburikidza nokuranganiwa novaJudha, <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />zvidodaipo ndidodududzaba kunyaira kwamuri zvese zvaibatsira, nokukudzidzisai pachenu uye muimba noimba, <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />ndichipfakazira vese kuvaJudha noyamwe marudzi pamusoro pokupinduka kunaMwari nokutenda muna Ishe wedu Jesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Manje, onai ndaakuenda kuJerusarema, ndidosungikana pamweya, ndisingazive zvichandiwana kwakareko; <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />kunze kwokundoti Mweya Mutsvene ari kupfakaza mumaguta yese kuti kusungiwa nokutambudziwa zvidondimirira. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Asi handiverenge upenyu hwangu kuti ndohwomhando kana hudokosha kwandiri, ndinondoda kupedzisa hwendo hwangu basi noushumiri hwandidotambira kubva kunaIshe Jesu, kupa chapupu kunhau idonaka yonyasha dzaMwari.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Saka zvino, chionai, ndinoziva kuti mese vandidosvikira pavari ndichiparidza umambo hamuchadzoona chiso changu pakare. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Nokudaro nasi ndinopupura kwamuri kuti ndidochena pamagazi yenyu mese, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Nokuti ndidodududzaba kukunyairirai kudzidzisa kwese kwaMwari. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Zvichenjererei noboka rese, ramudoitiwa vatariri varene naMweya Mutsvene, kuti murise Kherekhe yaMwari yaadowana nogazi romwanakomana wache. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ndinoziva kuti kana ndaenda masvitsi yanochisa yachauya pakati penyu, yasingasiye boka, <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />uye kubva pakati penyu vakaremi pachasumuka varume vachinyaira zvidotaika, kuti vakwezvere vadzidzi kwavari. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Nokudaro garai mudochenjerera, muchikumbuka kuti kwomakore matatu ndidorekaba usiku nomasikati kukurairai mese nomisodzi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Iye zvino ndinokuisai kunaMwari nokushoko ronyasha dzache, rinogona kukuvakhai nokukupasai nhaka pakati povese vadoitiwa vatsvene. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Handinai kutorera munhu sirivha kana ndarama kana hembe. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Imipa pachenyu munozviziva kuti manja aya yadondishandira zvandaida nozvaidiwa novandanga ndinavo. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Pazvinhu zvese ndidokunangidzai kuti pakushanda kwakareko umwe munhu anofanira kubatsira vadorukutika, muchikumbuka mazvi yaIshe Jesu, manyairiro yaadoita, ‘Zvinomakomborero yadonyanya kana ukapereka panzvimbo yokutambira.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Zvino Phauro paadonyaira daro, adopfugama ndokunamata navo vese. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Vadorira vese vachimuzvembetera nokumutsvoda, <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />vachisuwisiwa zvidokungudza nondava yomazvi yaanga wanyaira, kuti vaidzoonaba chiso chache. Uye vadodzomusvitsa kuchikepe.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Phauro anoenda kuJerusarema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Zvino patidopararana navo tidokhwasva, ndokuuya tidorungama kuKosi, nozuva ridozotevera tidosvika paRodzi, uye kubva pakarepo tidoenda kuPatara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ipopo patidowana chikepe chaigwatira nokuFonisiya, tidochikwira, ndokukwasva. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Patidosvika panoita kuti Saipurasi iwoneke, tichiisiya kurubose tidokhwasva kuenda kuSiriya, ndokumira paTire, ndava pakarepo chikepe chaidzoburutsa mutoro. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Patidotsvaga vadzidzi, tidodzogara mazuva manomwe pakarepo. Kuburikidza naMweya vadoudza Phauro kuti areke kuenda kuJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Zvino padopera mazuva yedu yokuva pakarepo, tidobirika ndokuenda hwendo hwedu, zvino ivo vese novanhukadzi novana, vadotiperekedza kusvika kunze kwoguta, uye patidopfugama pamahombekombe yogungwa tidonamata ndokugonekana. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Zvino tidokwira chikepe, ivo ndokudzokera kumba.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Patidopedza hwendo hwokubva kuTire, tidosvika paToremisi, ndokumoresa hama tichitogara navo zuva ribodzi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Mangwana yacho tidobirika ndokusvika muKesariya, saka tidopinda mumba maFiripi Muvhangeri, wanga ari umwe wovanomwe, ndokubva tagara naye. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Wanga ano vanasikana vanai dzanga dziri mhandara, vaiporofita. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Patidogara kwomazuva, muporofiti waiitiwa Agabhasi adouya achibva Judhiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Paadouya kwatiri adotora bhande raPhauro ndokuzvisunga makumbo nomanja, achiti, “Ndozviri kunyaihwa naMweya Mutsvene, ‘kuti vaJudha kuJerusarema vachasunga muridzi wobhande rakareri vomupereka mumanja yoyamwe marudzi.’”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Patidonzva zvakarezvi, isisu novanhu vopakarepo tidomuteterera kuti areke kuenda kuJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Zvino Phauro adopindura achiti, “Chii chamurikuita, muchirira nokupwanya mwoyo wangu? Nokuti ndidozvimisira aikona kusungiwa chete asi kana kutopfira zita raIshe Jesu kuJerusarema.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Paadoreka kupenzveredzeka, tidonyarara ndokuti, “Kuda kwaIshe mbakuitiwe.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Mumasure momazuva yakareya tidogadzirira ndokuenda kuJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Uye vamwe vovadzidzi vadobva kuKesariya vadoenda naisisu, vachitisvitsa kumba kwaMunasoni wokuSaipurasi, mudzidzi wokuthanga, wataifanira kugara naye.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro Anobvakachira Jakobho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Patidosvika kuJerusarema, hama dzidotitambira nomufaro. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Mangwana yacho Phauro adoenda naisisu kunaJakobho, uye vakuru vese vanga varipo. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Tapedza kuvamoresa, adorondedzera chibodzi nochibodzi chozvinhu zvese zvidoitiwa naMwari kuburikidza noushumiri hwache pakati poyamwe marudzi. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Zvino pavadozvinzva, vadorumbidza Mwari. Uye vadoti kuna Phauro, “Hama, unoona kuti zviuru zvingani zviripo pakati povaJudha vadotenda uye vanoshingairira mutemo. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Vadonyepewa pamusoro pako kuti uri kudzidzisa vaJudha vese vari pakati poyamwe marudzi kuti vasiye Mozisi, uchivanyepa kuti vareke kuchecheudza vana vavo kana kuchengeta tsika dzedu. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Zvino chii chatingaite? Chokwadi vachazvinzva kuti wauya. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Zvino chiita zvatichakunyairira, tinovarume vanai vari pasi pomhiko, <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Tora varume vakareva uzvinatse pabodzi navo woripa miripo, kuti vaguse bvudzi misoro yavo. Pakarepo vese vachaziva kuti hapanai chiripo pano zvavadonyepewa pamusoro pako, asi kuti iwewe pachako unorarama uchiteedza mutemo. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Asi pamusoro pomarudzi yadotenda, tatumira tsamba rino matongero yedu kuti vanofanira kusiyana nozvidobaihwa zvifananidzo nomusiya nozvidodzipiwa nokuita upombwe.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Naizvozvo Phauro adotora varumevo, pazuva ridotevera adozvinatsa pabodzi navo ndokupinda muimba yaMwari, kuti azivise paidzogumira mazuva yokuzvinatsa kwavo nokupereka chipo chinoperekewa nomunhu wese pakati pavo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro Ari muImba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Zvino mazuva manomwe payanga yaakutopera, vaJudha vadobva kuEzhiya, vadomuona muimba yaMwari, vadopesvedzera mhomho yese, ndokumusunga, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />vadodaidzira vachiti, “Varume voIzirairi, batsirai! Murume wakareyu ari kudzidzisa vanhu kwese kwese zvinopesana novanhu nonzvimbo ino, wauya pakare nomaGiriki muimba yaMwari, futi wasvipisa nzvimbo ino itsvene.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Nokuti mumasure vadombomuona muguta anaTirofimasi wokuEfeso, saka vadozimbwa kuti Phauro anogona kunge adopinda naye muimba yaMwari.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Zvino guta rese ridonyongana, vanhu ndokutizirana pabodzi; vadobata Phauro ndokumuzvuvira kunze kwoimba yaMwari, kabodzi nokabodzi masuwo makuru yadovhariwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Zvino pavaiedza kumubaya, shoko ridosvika kumukuru woboka romauto kuti Jerusarema rese rava nonyongano. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Pakarepo adotorerafuti mauto novakuru vomazana, ndokumhanyira kwavari, pavadoona mukuru womauto nomauto vadomira kurova Phauro. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Zvino mukuru womauto adosvika ndokumusunga, ndokuraira kuti asungiwe nongetani dziiri. Adobvunza kuti mbani pakare kuti chii chaanga waita. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Vamwe mumhomho vadodaidzira chimwe chinhu, vamwe chimwewo, saka paadotadza kubatitsitsa chinangwa nopamusaka pomhere mhere, adoraira kuti aendesewe kumuzinda womauto. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Manje paadosvika pazvikwiriso, wanga adototakuriwa nomauto nondava yomunyonga womhomho, <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Nokuti mhomho yovanhu yaitevera, ichidaidzira ichiti, “Mbaabisiwe!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro Anozvidairira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Zvino Phauro paanga wakuendesewa munhandare yomauto, adoti kumukuru wavo, “Ndinganyairewo zvimwe zvinhu kwamuri chere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Iye adoti, “Unoziva chiGiriki chere? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ndiweba chere muIjipiti adomutsa munyonga manjemanjepa ndokukweverera musango vapanduki vanosvika zviuru zvinai?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Phauro adopindura, “Inipano ndiri muJudha, anobva kuThasasi muSirisiya, mugari womuguta risiri romangamanga; ndinokukumbirai, nditenderei kunyaira kuvanhu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Paadomubvumidza, Phauro paanga adomira pazvikwiriso adoninira nojanja kuvanhu, pavadonyarara, adonyaira kwavari nochiHebheru, achiti,<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Hama dzangu nanababa, inzvai kuzvidairira kwandiri kuita pamberi penyu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Pavadomunzva kuti ari kunyaira kwavari nomutauro wochiHebheru, vadonyararitsa, Iye adoti,<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Ndiri muJudha, adozvarihwa muThasasi kuSirisiya, asi ndidokurira muguta rino nokudzidzisiwa naGamarieri, ndichidzidza nomutoo udooma womutemo womadzibaba vedu, ndichishingairira Mwari kunge zvamuri kuita mese nasi. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Ndidotambudza voNzira yakarei kusvika pakubaya, nokusunga ndichiendesa kutorongo vese vanhurume novanhukadzi, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />fanike zvinopiwa upfakazi nomuphirisita mukuru nodare rese rovakuru. Ndidotambira tsamba kubva kwavari ndichienda kuhama, uye ndidoita hwendo kuDhamasiko kotora kamu vaye vanga vari vokwakareko nokuvauyisa kuJerusarema vadosungiwa kuti varangiwe.”<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro anonyaira zvokuPinduka kwache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Mabasa yoNhumwa 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Pandanga ndiri pahwendo ndaakusvika kuDhamasiko, yatova masikati kupenya kudokungudza kudobva kudenga kudonditoya kabodzinokabodzi. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ndidowira pasi ndokubva ndanzva izvi richiti kwandiri, ‘Sauro, Sauro, unonditambudzireiko?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Ndidobva ndapindura ndichiti, ‘Ndimi yaniko, Ishe?’ Adoti kwandiri, ‘Ndini Jesu wokuNazareta wauri kutambudza.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Zvino vanga vanainini vadoona chiedza asi havanai kunzva izvi rowainyaira nainini. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Zvino ndidoti, ‘Ndoita tini, Ishe?’ Zvino Ishe adoti kwandiri, ‘Sumuka uyende kuDhamasiko, uchanyairihwa kwakareko zvese zvaudotarihwa kuti uite.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Pandidotadza kuona nokuda kwochiedza chidopenya chiye, ndidobatiwa ruoko ndokutungamirihwa kupinda muDhamasiko naabiyangu vandanga ndinavo.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Zvino umwe murume waitiwa Ananiyasi, munhu wanga adozvipira maererano nomutemo, waipupurihwa zvidonaka novaJudha vese vaigara kwakareko, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />adouya kwandiri, ndokumira panyasi nainini achiti kwandiri, ‘Hama Sauro, chitambira kuona kwako.’ Paawa yakareyo ndidomuona. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Iye adoti, ‘Mwari womadzibaba vedu adokugadza kuti uzive kuda kwache, kuti uone Adorurama Mubodzi uye kuti unzve izvi kubva pamuromo wache. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Nokuti uchava mupfakazi wache kuvanhu vese pamusoro pozvaudoona nozvaudonzva. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Zvino uchamirirei? Sumuka uombekewe, usukiwe zvitema zvako, udaidze kuzita rache.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudaidziwa kwaPhauro Koparidzira yamwe Marudzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Pandidodzokera kuJerusarema, ndaitonamata muimba yaMwari, ndidobatiwa datsi. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ndidomuona achiti kwandiri, ‘Ita kamangu ubirikiretu muJerusarema, nokuti havatambiri uchapupu hwako pamusoro pangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Zvino ndidoti, ‘Ishe, ivo pachavo vanoziva kuti mumasinagoge yese ndidoendesa kutorongo nokurova vaye vaitenda kwamuri. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Uye padoyeredzewa gazi raSitefani mupfakazi wenyu, naininiwo ndidomiririra ndichizvisimbisa, ndichichengeta hembe dzovaye vaimutaka.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Uye iye adoti kwandiri, ‘Birika, ndava ndichakutuma kurefu kuyamwe marudzi.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Vadomutetekera kusvikira pamashoko yakareya, zvino vadosimudza mazvi yavo vachiti, “Kurefu nomunhu adodaro, mbaabirike panyika! Ndava anofaniraba kuchira.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Zvino pavaidaidzira vachivhuzura majasi yavo mudenga vachimwaya pfumbi mumhepo, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mukuru womauto adonyaira kuti vamuendese kumuzinda womauto, ndokuraira kuti vamuongorore nonzira yokumurova, kuti azive chikonzero vanhu vadodaidzira vachimupikisa zvidodaro. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Asi pavadomusunga nothambo, Phauro adoti kumutungamiri wozana wanga adomira pakarepo, “Zviri pamutemo chere kwamuri kuti murove munhu anenge ari nzvahwa yoRoma asinai kupasiwa mhosva?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Zvino mutungamiri wozana romauto paadonzva zvakarezvo, adoenda kumukuru womauto ndokuti kwaari, “Chii chawaakuita? Nokuti munhu wakareyu inzvahwa yoRoma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Nokudaro mukuru womauto adoenda ndokuti kwaari, “Ndinyepe, uri muRoma chere?” Iye adoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">“Eye.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mukuru womauto adopindura achiti, “Inini ndidotenga mvumo yokuva muRoma nomari idowanditsa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Phauro adoti, “Asi inini ndiri nzvahwa,”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Saka vaye vanga vaakudzomuongorora vadobva vabirika nokamangu paanga ari, nomukuru womauto wanga waakucha, nokuti wanga waakuziva kuti Phauro muRoma apa wanga wamusunga.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro Pamberi poDare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Asi mangwana yacho, paaida kuziva chikonzero chomhosva yaanga achinenedzehwa novaJudha, adomusugudura, ndokuraira vaphirisita vakuru nodare rese kuti vasangane, uye adouya naPhauro ndokumuisa pamberi pavo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Zvino Phauro adonangaritsa kudare, ndokuti, “Hama, ndidorarama pamberi paMwari ndino hana idonaka kusvika pazuva ranasi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Pakarepo muphirisita mukuru Ananiyasi adoraira vaye vanga vadomira naye kuti vamunzetemure pamuromopo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Zvino Phauro adoti kwaari, “Mwari vachakurova iwepa madziro yadochenesewa kunze! Uri ngukhukhu kugarikika kuti unditonge maererano nomutemo, asi uchipikisana nomutemo pakuraira kuti ndirohwe?”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Vaye vanga vadomira panyasi vadoti, “Unotukana muphirisita mukuru waMwari?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Ipopo Phauro adoti, “Handinai kuziva, hama, kuti ndiye muphirisita mukuru, nokuti kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Reka kunyaira zvidoipa pamusoro pomutongi wovanhu vako.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Asi Phauro paadoziva kuti chikwata chibodzi nyhovaSadhusi chimwe vaFarisi, adodaidzira mudare achiti, “Hama, ndiri muFarisi, mwanakomana womuFarisi, Nopamusaka potariro uye nokumuka kwovadopfa ndiri pakutongesewa.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Iye paadonyaira zvakarezvi, kupararana kudomuka pakati povaFarisi novaSadhusi, uye dare ridokamuka. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Nokuti vaSadhusi vanoti hakunai kumuka kwovadopfa, kana ngirozi, kana mweya, asi vaFarisi vanozvitambira zvese. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Nokudaro padoita ruzha ridokura, uye vamwe vanyori vochikwata chovaFarisi vadosumuka vachipikisa vachiti, “Hapanai zvidoipa zvataona pamurume wakareyu. Ko kana uri mweya kana ngirozi idonyaira naye?”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Zvino kupikisana pakudodzova nomunyonga, mukuru womauto, adocha kuti Phauro waidzoitiwa kanyama kanyama navo, adoraira mauto kuti vamutore nochisimba vachimubiritsa pakati pavo nokumuendesa kumuzinda womauto.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Usiku hudotevera Ishe adomira naye ndokuti, “Tsunga mwoyo, ndava sekupfakaza kwawaita pamusoro pangu muJerusarema, saka unofanira kupfakaza pakare kuRoma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rangano nozvoupenyu hwaPhauro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Pakwanga kwachena vaJudha vadoita chirangano ndokuzvipikira mhiko yokuti vaijaba kana kumwa kusvikira vabaya Phauro. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Vanga vadowanda zvokupindirira makumi manai vadorangana chiziriri. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ipopo vadoenda kuvapirisita vakuru nokuvakuru, ndokuvati, “Tazvisunga zvidooma nokupika kurega kuraidza chokuja kusvikira tabaya Phauro. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Saka imipa, nodare perekai chiziviso izvozvi kumukuru womauto kuti vauye naye kwamuri, moita kunge munoda kunzvitsitsa nyaya yache chaiyo. Isisu tidotogadzirira kumubaya anati wasvika papfupi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Zvino mwanakomana wohanzvadzi yaPhauro adonzva zvokuda kuhwandira kwavo; saka adoenda ndokupinda mumuzinda womauto achibva wataurira Phauro. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Zvino Phauro adodaidza umwe wovakuru vozana ndokuti, “Endesa mukomana uyu kumukuru womauto, ndava ano zvaanoda kumunyepa.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Saka adomutora ndokumuendesa kumukuru womauto achiti, “Phauro musungwa adondidaidza ndokundikumbira kuti ndiuye kwamuri nomukomana wakareyu, sezvo ano zvinhu zvokunyaira kwamuri.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mukuru womauto adomubata ruoko, ndokuenda naye kwavo vega achimubvunza zvidohwanzika ndokumuti, “Chii chaunoda kundinyepa?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Iye adoti, “VaJudha vadotenderana kukukumbirai kuti muunze Phauro kudare mangwana, fanike vanoda kudzobvunzitsitsa pamusoro pache vari papfupi. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Asi rekai kuvatetekera, nokuti vabiyavo vanodarika makumi manai vadoronga kumuhwandira, vadozvisunga nokupika kuti damba kuja kana kumwa kusvikira vamubaya, saka zvino vatogadzirira, vandomirira mvumo yenyu basi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Saka mukuru womauto adoendesa mukomana, ndokumutsindikira achiti, “Reka kunyairira munhu kuti wandinyepa zvakarezvi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro Anotumihwa kuna Ferekisi Mutongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Zvino adodaidza vakuru vozana vairi ndokuti, “Paawa yochitatu yousiku gadzirirai mauto mazana mairi pabodzi novarume vopamabhiza vanomakumi manomwe novarume mazana mairi vomapfumo kuti vaende zvokusvika, kuKesariya. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Unziraiwo Phauro bhiza nochokugarira, momusvitsa adochengeteka kunaFerekisi mutongi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Uye adonyora tsamba idodai,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Khiraudhiyasi Raisiyasi kuna Anoremekedzewa mutongi Ferekisi, moroi. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Munhu uyu adobatiwa novaJudha, uye wanga akutobaiwa navo, pandidovasvikira ndinomauto ndokumusvokodza, pandidonzvitsitsa kuti iye muRoma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Uye pakuda kunzvitsitsa mhosva yavaimunenedzera, ndidomuendesa kudare ravo, <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ndidoona kuti wainenedzehwa zvinochokuita nomibvunzo yomutemo wavo, asi kutongewa kusinai chingade ipfa kana torongo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Zvino pazvidoisiwa pachenu kwandiri kuti panga patoita kuhwandihwa kwomunhu wakareyu, ndidomutumira kwamuri kamangu, nokuraira vapikisi vache kuti vatsanangure pamberi penyu zvavanopikisana naye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Saka mauto, zvidoenderana nokuraihwa kwavo, vadotora Phauro ndokumuendesa usiku kuna Andipatirisi. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Mangwana yacho vadodzokera kumuzinda, vachisiya vomabhiza kuti vaende naye. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Pavadosvika kuKesariya vachipasa tsamba kunomutongi, vadoperekawo Phauro pamberi pache. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Paadoverenga tsamba, adobvunza dunhu rache kuti ndipi. Paadoziva kuti waibva kuSirisiya <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />adoti, “Ndichakunzva kana vanenedzeri vako vasvika.” Zvino adoraira kuti achengetewe ari mumuzinda waHerudhe.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Murandu waPhauro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Mumasure momazuva mashano muphirisita mukuru Ananiyasi adoenda novamwe vakuru nogweta rinoitiwa Taturasi. Vadoisa nyaya yavo yokupikisa Phauro pamberi pomutongi. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Zvino Taturasi paadodaidziwa, adothanga kumunenedzera murandu, achiti, “Sezvazviri, nondava yenyu tinokondwa kuti tinorugare rikuru, uye nokuda kwomuono wenyu woromangwana ridonaka zvaunza shanduko munyika ino. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Kwese uye nonzira dzese vanoremekedzewa Ferekisi, tinotambira zvinhu zvakarezvi nomufaro mukuru. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Asi, kuti ndireke kuramba ndidokusvanikai, ndinokutetereraiwo notsitsi dzenyu kuti mutinzvewo kwonguwa ipfupi. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Nokuti tidoona kuti munhu wakareyu imharadzi, anofurira vamwe pakati povaJudha vese panyika yese, uye mutungamiri wokaboka komaNazarini. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Adotoedza kusvipisa imba yaMwari, asi tidobva tamusunga. Taitoda kumutonga maererano nomutemo wedu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Asi mukuru womauto, Risiyasi adouya ndokumubvuta kwatiri nochisimba. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Adobva waraira kuti vapikisi vaPhauro vauye kwamuri. Saka kuburikidza nokumuongorora pachenyu munogona kuziva kubva kwaari pamusoro pozvese zvatiri kumunenedzera.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />VaJudha vadobatanawo naRisiyasi, vachisimbisa kuti izvozvi zvese ndizvo chaizvo.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro anozvidziirira pamberi paFerekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Zvino mutongi paadomunangidza kuburikidza nojanja kuti anyaire, Phauro adopindura achiti, “Nokuziva kuti muri mutongi worudzi rakareri kwomakore mazinji, ndinozvidziirira nomufaro. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Sezvamunogona kuziva, hayasi mazuva yanopfuura gumi nomairi kubva pandidoenda konamata kuJerusarema, <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />uye havanai kundiona ndichipikisana nomunhu kana ndichimutsa munyonga nomhomho, kana muimba yaMwari kana musinagoge, kana muguta. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Futi havagone kukuonesai ipopa upfakazi hwozvinhu zvavari kundinenedzera. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Asi zvandinobvuma pamberi penyu nzvizvi, kuti maererano noNzira, yavanodaidza kuti idotaika, ndinonamata Mwari womadzibaba vedu, ndichitenda zvese zvidoisiwa mumutemo nokunyohwa muvaporofiti. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Ndinotariro muna Mwari yavanotambira vakareva pachavo, kuti kuchava nokumuka kwovese vadorurama novasinai kururama. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Saka ndinototsunga panozvese kuva nohana idochena pamberi paMwari nopamberi povanhu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Zvino mumasure momakore yadotikuti ndidouya kopereka rubatsiro nozvipo kunyika yangu. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Pandanga ndichiita zvakarezvi, vadondiwana ndanatsiwa muimba yaMwari, pasinai kana mhomho zvayene yandanga ndinayo, kana kuti ndidokonzera munyonga. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Asi pano vaJudha vadobva kuEzhiya vaifanira kuva pano pamberi penyu kuti vapasewo chokunenedzera, kana vano chavanopikisana nainini. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Kana kuti varume vakareva pachavo mbavanyaire kuti nzvipi zvidoipa zvavadoona pandidomira pamberi podare, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />kunze kwochibodzi chandidodaidzira pandidomira pakati pavo, ‘Chokuremekedza zvokumuka kuvadopfa ndava pano nasi ndichitongewa pamberi penyu.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Asi Ferekisi, nokuva noruzivo rudojeka pamusoro poNzira, adovamisa, achiti, “Kana Risiyasi mukuru womauto wauya kuno, ndichapasa mutongo kunyaya yenyu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Zvino adopasa chirevo kumukuru wozana chokuti achengetewe muusungwa asi ano kusununguka, uye kuti shamwari dzache dzireke kurambidziwa kumubatsira pano zvaanoda.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro pamberi paFerekisi naDhurusira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Mumasure momazuva Ferekisi adouya nomukadzi wache Dhurusira, wanga ari muJudha, zvino adodaidza Phauro kuti amutetekere achitaura pamusoro pokutenda muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />paanga achitsanangura nozvo kuenzanisa nokuzvibata nokutongewa kunodzouya, Ferekisi adochisiwa ndokuti, “Birika uyende parizvino, kana ndawana mukana ndichakudaidza.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Panguwa ibodziyo adotarisira kuti waidzopasiwa mari naPhauro. Saka adoramba achimudaidza achinyaira naye kadowanda.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Asi padopera makore mairi, panzvimbo yaFerekisi padopinda Posiyasi Fesitasi, uye achida kufadza vaJudha, Ferekisi adosiya Phauro ari muturongo.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Phauro Anokwidza Nyaya kunaSiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Zvino Fesitasi paadouya mudunhu rache, mumasure momazuva matatu adoenda kuJerusarema achibva kuKesariya. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Ipopo vaphirisita vakuru novakuru vovaJudha vadomuzivisa zvavaipikisana naPhauro, ndokumuteterera, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />vachimukumbira tsvete kuti murume wakareyo atumihwe kuJerusarema, vachironga kudzomuhwandira vomubaya munzira. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fesitasi adopindura kuti Phauro adochengetewa kuKesariya, uye iye pachake waitarisira kuenda kwakareko nokamangu. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Adoti, “Saka itai kuti, vakuru pakati penyu vaende neni, uye kana pano zvidonyangara pamunhu wakareyu, mbavamunenere.” <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Paadogara pakati pavo kwomazuva yasingapfuure masere kana gumi, adoenda kuKesariya, uye pazuva ridotevera adogara pamupando wache nodare ndokuraira kuti vauye naPhauro kwaari. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Zvino paadouya, vaJudha vanga vabva kuJerusarema vadomira vadomukomberedza, vachimunenedzera mirandu mizinji idokuritsa yavadotadza kupasa umboo hunogutsa. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Phauro pakuzvidairira adoti, “Handinai chidoipa chandidoita kana kupikisana nomutemo wovaJudha, kana kupikisana noimba yaMwari, kana kupikisana naSiza.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Asi Fesitasi pakuda kuitira tsvete vaJudha, adoti kuna Phauro, “Unoda chere kuenda kuJerusarema, kuti watongewa kwakareko pamusoro pomirandu yakarei pamberi pangu?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Asi Phauro adoti, “Ndiri kudzomira pamberi podare raSiza, pandinofanira kuyedzewa, kuvaJudha hapanai chandidoita chidonyangara, sezvamunonatsa kuziva. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Kana ndiri muiti wozvidonyangara, uye ndidopara chimwe chinhu chandinofanira kupfira, handisi kutsvaga kunzvenga ipfa, asi kana pasinai chiripo pakundinenedzera kwavo, hapanai anokodzero yokundiisa kwavari. Ndinokwidza nyaya yangu kunaSiza.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Pakarepo Fesitasi, paadorangana nodare, adopindura achiti, “Wakwidza nyaya kuna Siza, saka uchaenda kuna Siza.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro pamberi paAgiripa naBhenisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Zvino mazuva mashoma yadoti yapera, mambo Agiripa naBhenisi vadosvika kuKesariya kotambira Fesitasi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Sezvo vadogara pakarepo mazuva mazinji, Fesitasi adoisa nyaya yaPhauro pamberi pamambo, achiti, “Panomunhu adosiiwa naFerikisi ari muusungwa, <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />uye pandanga ndiri kuJerusarema vaphirisita vakuru novakuru vovaJudha vadondizivisa pamusoro pache, vachikumbira kuti atongehwe kuisiwa mutorongo. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ndidovapindura kuti haisi tsika yochiRoma kupereka munhu upi zvache kana munenedzehwi wacho asinati wakumana chiso nochiso novanenedzeri, uye asinati wawana mukana wokuzvidairira pamirandu yaari kunenedzehwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Zvino pavadodzouya kuno pabodzi, handinai kuchehwa, asi pazuva ridotevera ndidogara pamupando wangu padare ndokuraira kuti vauye nomurume wacho. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Zvino vanenedzeri pavadosumuka, havanai kupasa umboo hunobatika panyaya yache sezvandaitarisira, <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Asi vanga vanozvimwe zvavanga vachipikisana naye pamusoro pozvavanotenda uye nopamusoro poumwe anoitiwa Jesu, wanga adopfa, asi Phauro achisimbisa kuti mupenyu. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Ndidokundikana kuwana zvinobatika pamusoro ponyaya yakarei, ndidomubvunza kana waida kuenda kuJerusarema kotongewa kwakareko pamusoro pomirandu yakarei. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Asi Phauro paadokwidza nyaya yache adoda kuchengetewa muusungwa kuti adzotongewa nomutongi Siza. Saka ndidomuraira kuti achengetewe kusvikira ndadzomutumira kuna Siza.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Ipopo Agiripa adoti kunaFesitasi, “Ndinoda kumunzva murume wakareyu pachangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Iye adoti, “Muchamunzva mangwana.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Saka mangwana yacho Agiripa naBhenisi vadouya vadosimira mbacha dzinodhura dzidonakitsa, ndokupinda muimba ikuru yokutongera vano vakuruvakuru vomauto novakuru voguta. Zvino nokuraira kwaFesitasi vadouya naye Phauro. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesitasi adoti, “Mambo Agiripa naimipa mese muri pano, munoona murume wakareyu wandidokumbihwa pamusoro pache novanhu vese vochiJudha, vese vokuJerusarema nopano, vachidaidzira kuti haafaniri kuenderera mberi nokuchira. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Asi ndidowana kuti haanai chaadoita chingamusvitse paipfa, uye iye pachake zvaakwidza nyaya kuno mutongi mukuru, ndasarudza kumuendesa. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Asi handinai chaicho chokunyora kunaishe wangu pamusoro pache. Saka ndamuunza pamberi penyu, uye kunyanya pamberi penyu, mambo Agiripa, kuti, mumasure mokumuongorora, ndiwanewo chokunyora. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Nokuti kwandiri zvinova zvisinai hwenye, kutumira musungwa, pasinai kunangidza murandu waanonenedzehwa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Phauro anozvidairira pamberi paAgiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agiripa adoti kuna Phauro, “Uno mvumo yokuzvinyairira wega.” Zvino Phauro adotambanudza janja rache ndokuzvidairira achiti,<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Ndinofunga kuti ndinorombo ridonaka kuti ndiri pamberi penyu, Mambo Agiripa, ndaakuzvidairira nasi ndichipikisa zvese zvandiri kunenedzehwa novaJudha, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />ndava imipa kunyanya munoruzivo notsika dzese dzochiJudha nopavanopesana, nokudaro ndinokukumbiritsai kuti muite mwoyo murefu kunditetekera.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Mararamiro yangu kubva paukomana, ndidopedza nguwa yokuthanga ndiri pakati porudzi rangu kuJerusarema, zvinozikana novaJudha vese. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Vadozviziva kwonguwa irefu, kana vachida kuzvipupura, kuti maererano nochikwata chidoometsetsa chokunamata ndidorarama semuFarisi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Uye ipopa ndidomira pano ndichitongewa nokuda kwotariro muchivimbiso chidoitiwa naMwari kumadzibaba vedu, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />kuno yakarei marudzi yedu gumi nomairi vanogurupira kuiwana, pavanonamata vadoperera masikati nousiku. Uye nondava yotariro yakarei ndiri kunenedzehwa novaJudha, Changamire! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Ndavayeiko muchifunga kuti zvidooma kuti Mwari anomutsa vadopfa?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Inipano ndanga ndidogutsikana kuti ndaifanira kuita zvinhu zvidowanda zvinopesana nozita raJesu woNazareta. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Uye ndidoita zvakarezvo muJerusarema, handinai kundoisa chete mutorongo vatsvene vadowanda, nomasimba yadobva kuvapirisita vakuru, asi pavaibaiwa ndaitsigira ndichibvumirana nazvo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Uye ndaivaranga kadowanda mumasinagoge yese nokuedza kuvaita kuti vashore Mwari, futi pakuvazondetsa, ndidovatambudza nokumaguta yovatohwa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro anonyaira zvokupinduka kwache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Mabasa yoNhumwa 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Saka ndidoenda kuDhamasiko musimba nomvumo yovaphirisita vakuru. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Panguwa dzomasikati, Mambo, ndidoona chiedza munzira chidobva kudenga, chidopenya kukunda zuva, chichivhenekera pandanga ndiri novanga vachifamba nainini. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Zvino patidowira pasi tese, ndidonzva dzinga richiti kwandiri nomutauro wochiHebheru, ‘Sauro, Sauro, unonditambudzireiko? Zvinokukuwadza kupura zvinotonzva.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Zvino ndidoti, ‘Ndimi yaniko, Ishe?’ Iye Ishe adoti, ‘Ndini Jesu wauri kutambudza. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Asi chisumuka, ndava ndazvinangidza kwauri nochikonzero chakarechi, kukusarudza kuti uve mushandi nomupfakazi wozvinhu zvawaona nozvandichakunangidza. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Ndichikuhwira kuvanhu vokwako nokunovasinganamate kwandichakutuma. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Usvinudze meso yavo, nokuvapindutsa kubva murima vachienda kuchiedza, uye kubva kusimba raSathani vachienda kuna Mwari, kuti vatambire kuregerehwa kwozvitadzo, nonzvimbo pakati povadoitiwa vatsvene nokutenda mandiri.’”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro anonyaira zvobasa rache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Naizvozvo, Mambo Agiripa, handinai kuramba kuteerera kuchiratidzo chokudenga, <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />asi ndidotaura ndichithanga kuno avo vokuDhamasikasi, ndokudzouya vokuJerusarema nomunyika yese yoJudhiya, nokuyamwe marudzi, kuti vanofanira kupinduka vadzoke kunaMwari uye voita mabasa yanoenderana nokupinduka kwavo. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Nondava yakarei vaJudha vadondisunga muimba yaMwari ndokuedza kundibaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Kusvika pazuva ranasi ndanga ndichiwana kubatsira kunobva kunaMwari, saka ndinomira pano ndichipupura kuno vese vadiki novakuru, ndisinganyaire chinhu asi zvidonyaihwa novaporofiti naMozisi kuti zvichaitika, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />kuti Khirisitu waidzotambudzika, uye nokudzova wokuthanga pakumuka kuvadopfa, waidzoparidzira chiedza kuvanhu vache nokuyamwe marudzi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Naizvozvo paanga achizvidairira, Fesitasi adoti nodzinga rikuru, “Phauro, waakupenga, kudzidza kwako kukuru kwaakukupengesa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Asi Phauro adoti, “Handisi kupenga, anoremekedzewa Fesitasi, asi ndiri kunyaira chokwadi chiri pachenu. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Ndava mambo anoziva pamusoro pozvinhu zvakarezvi, uye ndinonyaira ndidosununguka kwaari, nokuti ndinoziva kuti hapanai chidokuphonyai pazvinhu zvakarezvi, ndava zvakarezvi zvidoitihwaba padohwanda. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mambo Agiripa, munotenda vaporofiti chere? Ndinoziva kuti munotenda.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Zvino Agiripa adoti kunaPhauro, “Munguwa ipfupipfupi wafunga kundiita muKhirisitu!”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Phauro adoti, “Kana ikava ipfupi kana irefu, ndingade kuti dai Mwari waita kuti mureke kuva imipa mega asi novese vari kundinzva nasi kuti vavewo kunge inini kusiya kwokuva nongetani dzakaredzi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Zvino mambo adosumuka, nomutongi naBhenisi noavo vavanga vadogara navo, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />saka pavanga vabirika, vadotaurirana vachiti, “Murume wakareyu haasi kuita chinhu chinoenderana noipfa kana kusungiwa.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Uye Agiripa adoti kuna Fesitasi, “Murume wakareyu angadai wasununguriwa dai asinai kukwidza nyaya kuna Siza.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Phauro anoenda kuRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Zvino pazvidosarudziwa kuti tiende kuItari, vadopereka Phauro novamwe vasungwa kumukuru wozana romauto yohondo, waiitiwa Juriyasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Ipopo tidopinda muchikepe chokuAdhiramitiyamu, changa chaakutosumuka kuenda kuzviteshe zvomumhenderekedzo dzoEzhiya, tidopinda mugungwa tichiperekedzewa naArisitakasi, wokuMakedhoniya waibva kuThesaronika. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Zuva ridotevera tidoenzera paSidhoni, uye Juriyasi adobata Phauro zvinotsitsi, ndokumupasa mvumo yokuenda kushamwari dzache kuti ariritihwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Pakupinda mugungwa kubva pakarepo tidokwasva tiri pakudzivirihwa kweSaipurasi, ndava duthu raipikisana nesu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Uye patidokhwasva nodivi rinogwata gungwa tichisiya Sirisiya noPamufiriya, tidosvika paMaira muRisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Pakarepo mukuru wozana romauto adowana chikepe chokuArekizandiriya chaienda kuItari, ndokutipinza makaremo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tidokwasva pashomapashoma kwomazuva yanoverengeka, ndokusvika nomatsurutsuru patidosiya Kinidhasi, sezvo duthu harinai kutitendera kuenda mberi, tidokwasva tiri nopamukoto woKhireti tatarisana noSarome. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tichishupika kuipindirira munyasi mayene, tidosvika panzvimbo inoitiwa Chiteshe choFeya, paiva papfupi noguta roRasiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Nguwa idowanda yanga yapera, nohwendo hwanga hwatova munjodzi nokuti zuva rokutsanya ranga rapfuura, Phauro adovayambira, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />achiti, “Varume, ndinoona kuti hwendo huchava nonjodzi nokurasikihwa kukuru, kusiri kwozvinhu nochikepe chete, asi noupenyu hweduwo.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Asi mukuru wozana romauto adotetekera zvidonyanya kumukuru wochikepe nokumuridzi wachene kukunda zvidonyairiwa naPhauro. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Uye nondava yokuti pachiteshe panga pasinai kukodzera kupedza mwaka wochando vari pakarepo, vazinji vadopasa zano rokuti vaende mberi mugungwa kubva pakarepo, nokugurupira kuti pamwe vaidzondosvika Fonikisi, panhandare yoKhireti, panosangana mhepo yokumaodzanyemba kudodziva kumabvazuva noyokuchamhembe kudodziva kumabvazuva, uye vaidzova pakarepo mumwaka wochando.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duthu paGungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Zvino padovhuvhuta duthu rokuchamhembe zvidodzikamira, vachifunga kuti zvavanga vachigurupira zvaitika, vadobisa zvibatiso ndokukhwasva vachideva vari munyasi momahombekombe yoKhireti, papfupi nomukati mochiteshe. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Asi nokamangu duthu ridosimbitsa rinobva kumusoro rinoitiwa, rokumaodzanyemba kudodziva kumabvazuva ridorova richibva panyika, <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />zvino chikepe pachidobatiwa hachinai kukwanisa kunangarana noduthu. Tidoreka zvidodaipo uye tidondogwididzihwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Pakutizira nopadodziirihwa nokatsuwa kadiki kanoitiwa Khaudha, tidokwanisa kuchengetedza kamwadiya nokutambudzika. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Mumasure mokukasumudza vadotora matanho yokusimbisa chikepe. Zvino vachicha kuti vaidzomhanyira paSitisi, vadodzura chibatiso, ndokureka chikepe chichigwididzihwa nomhepo. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Pataimbondogwididzihwa zvidonyangara noduthu, zuva ridotevera vadothanga kukhanda mitoro yochikepe kunze. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Futi pazuva rochitatu vadotaya midziyo yochikepe nomanja yavo pachavo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Zvino pakusinai kuoneka zuva kana nyenyedzi kwomazuva yadowanda, futi risiri duthu ridiki ridova patiri, ipopo tariro yedu yese yokuchira tidopedzisira taitaya.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Mumasure mokunge vapedza nguwa irefu vasinai zvokuja, Phauro adoenda pamberi pakati pavo ndokuti, “Varume dai mudonditetekera, mudoreka kusumuka muchibirika paKhireti, dai musinai kudzosangana nonjodzi nokurasikihwa kwakareku. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Zvino ndaakukukumbirai kuti murambe mudoshinga. Ndava pachaitikaba kurasikihwa noupenyu pakati penyu, asi chikepe basi. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Nokuti usiku hwakarehuno ngirozi yaMwari wangu wandinonamata yamira nainini <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ikanditi, ‘Reka kucha, Phauro, unofanira kumira pamberi paSiza, saka nangara, Mwari wakupasa vese ava vanokwasva naiwewe.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Saka tsungai mwoyo, varume, ndava ndinokutenda muna Mwari kuti zvichava chaizvoizvo sekunyairihwa kwandaitiwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Asi tichataihwa pachimwe chitsuwa.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Padosvika usiku hwochigumi nohunai, pataigwididzihwa pakati pogungwa roAdhiriyatiki, panenge pakati pousiku vakwasvi vadozimbwa kuti vaapapfupi nonyika. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Saka vadopima ndokuwana pari pagwiri zvokusvika zviyero makumi mairi. Pamberi pacho zvishoma vadopima pakare ndokuwana pava pagwiri zvokusvika zviyero gumi nozvishano. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />pakucha kuti tinodzorovera pamabhwe, vadodzikisa zviremereso zvinai kubva kumasure kwochikepe, ndokunamatira kuti zuva ribude. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Zvino vakhwasvi pavaitsvaga mapukunyukiro kubva muchikepe, ndava vanga vaderedza chikepe mugungwa, vachiita kunge vaidzikisa kamwadiya kubva pazasi, <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Phauro adoti kumukuru wozana romauto nokumauto, “Kusiya kwokunge varume vakareva varamba vari muchikepe, hamungaponesewe.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Saka mauto yadogwata thambo dzokamwadiya, ndokukasiya kachienda.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Utonga pahwanga hwatsvuka, Phauro adovakurudzira vese kuti vaje, achiti, “Nasi rava zuva rochigumi nomanai musingaje, muchindonangarira mudondodaro. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Manje ndinokukumbirai kuti mutore zvokuja. Zvichakupasai simba, zvapasisina kana kabvudzi kachaparara kubva mumusoro woupi zvache pakati pedu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ipopo paadonyaira zvakarezvi, adotora mazingwa, ndokupasa kutenda kunaMwari pamberi pavo vese, ndokuchikomora ndokuthanga kuja. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Saka vese vadokurudzirika ndokujawo zvokuja pachavo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Tese pabodzi muchikepe taisvika mazana mairi nomakumi manomwe novatanhatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Uye pavadoja vachiguta, vadorerutsa chikepe, vachikhandira gorosi mugungwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubamuka kwochikepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Zvino pakwanga kwachena, havanai kuziva nzvimbo yakareyo, asi vadoona padandaro pokuzororera. Vadokungura kuti dai zvaigoneka vaiunza chikepe pachiteshe. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Saka vadogwata zvisimbiso ndokuzvisiya mugungwa, ukuwo vachisugudura thambo dzaisunga zvokukwasvisa. Zvino vachisumudzira kumberi duthu richivhuvhuta vadosvika pachiteshe. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Asi pachidorovera pajecha, gumakuma rachene ridonamira pasi ndokurambirira. Apawo kumasure kwachene kudoparadziwa nosimba rosaisai.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Urongwa hwomauto hwanga huri hwokubaya vasungwa, kuti vareke kuyachira vachipunyuka. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Asi mukuru wozana romauto, nokuti waida kuchidza Phauro, adovarambidza kuita chinangwa chavo. Adoraira vaye vaikona kuyachira kuti vathange kuzvikhanda kumberi kuti vasvike panyika. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Vamwe vese vadoenda vari pazvimuti zvidovezewa nopazvidimbu zvochikepe. Saka zvidoitika kuti vese vadopukunyuka vachienda kunze.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">PaMorota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Mumasure mokupukunyuka kwedu, tidodzoziva kuti chitsuwa changa chichiitiwa Merita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Uye vagari vopakarepo vadotiitira tsitsi dzidonyanya, ndava vadobatidza moto ndokutikokera tese, nokuti kwanga kwathanga kuna uye kwaakutonhora. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Phauro wanga waunganidza kasvinga kohuni ndokuisa pamoto, padobva pabirika nyoka nokuda kwokupisa ndokumuruma pajanja rache. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Vagari vopanzvimbo yakareyo pavadoona nyokayo yarembera pajanja rache, vadonyairirana vachiti, “Munhu wakareyu imhondi, saka kunyange wapukunyuka zvache kubva pagungwa, kuenzanisa kwamubvumiraba kuchira.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Asi zvidodaipo zvazvene Phauro adozunzira nyokayo mumoto futi haanai kunzva kudzimba kudomutambudza nokuti haanai kukuwadziwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Vadomirira, vachimufungira kuti achazvimba kana kundoerekana wakomoka achipfa, asi pavadomirira nguwa irefu vachiona pasinai zvidonyangara zvichiitika kwaari, vadosandura mafungiro yavo, ndokubva vati ndimwari.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Zvino papfupi nonzvimbo yakareyo kwaiva nonzvimbo yomurume waiva mukuru wochitsuwa, waiitiwa Pabhiriyasi, adotitambira nokutivaraidza zvokwabhwino kwomazuva matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Zvidoitika kuti baba vache Pabhiriyasi vanga vadoenzera vachihwara nomuiri nokuita manyoka, saka Phauro adopinda makaremo ndokunamata, adoturika manja yache pavari ndokuvaporesa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Pazvidoitika zvakarezvi, vanhu vese vopachitsuwa vanga vachihwara vadouya ndokuporesewa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Vadotipasa zvipo zvidowanda, patanga taakuenda, vadotirongedzera zvese zvataida.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubva paMorota kuenda kuRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Mumasure momwedzi mitatu tidopinda muchikepe changa chapedza mwaka womhepo chiri muchitsuwa, chikepe chokuArekizandiriya, chidoisiwa mufananidzo womusoro wovakomana mambasa. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Patidoenzera paSairakasi, tidogara pakarepo kwomazuva matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Uye kubva pakarepo tidotenderera ndokusvika paRejiyamu, mumasure mozuva ribodzi duthu rokuchamhembe ridosumuka, zvino pazuva rochipiri tidosvika paPuteyori. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Pakarepo tidowana hama, ndokubva takokewa kuti tigare navo mazuva manomwe. Saka tidosvika kuRoma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Ipopo hama dzomakaremo, padzidonzva pamusoro pedu, vadouya kudzosangana naisisu vachibva kurefurefu sekuguta raApiyasi nomaguta matatu yaidaidziwa kuti yokutandarira. Phauro paadovaona adotenda Mwari futi zvidomusimbisa.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Patidosvika muRoma, Phauro adotendehwa kuti agare wega, adochengetedzewa nomuuto.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Kwapera mazuva matatu adodaidza pabodzi vatungamiri vovaJudha vomunzvimbo yakareyo, zvino pavadoungana, adoti kwavari, “Hama, kana ndisinai chandidoita ndichitadzira vanhu kana tsika dzomadzibaba vedu, asi zvidodaipo ndidoperekewa mumanja yovaRoma ndiri musungwa kubva kuJerusarema. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Pavadondiongorora, vadoda kundisunungura, ndava panga pasinai chikonzero chokuti ndipfe pamurandu wangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Asi vaJudha pavadopikisa, ndidomanikidzihwa kukwidza nyaya kuna Siza kana pasinai chinhu chandinomhangarira rudzi rangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Nochikonzero chakarechi ndakumbira kuti ndikuonei nokunyaira naimimi, nokuti nochikonzero chotariro yovaIzirairi ndidosungiwa nongetani dzakaredzi.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Saka vadoti kwaari, “Hatinai kutambira tsamba kubva kuJudhiya pamusoro pako, futi pahama dzese dziri kuuya kuno hapanai adopasa upfakazi kana kunyaira zvidonyangara pamusoro pako. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Asi tinoda kunzva kwauri kuti maonero yako njapi, nokuti pamusoro poboka rakareri tinoziva kuti kwesekwese riri kutauriwa zvokuripikisa,” <verse eid="ACT 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Pavadosarudza zuva rache, vadodzoenda vadowanda kwaanga achigara. Zvino adotsanangura nyaya kwavari kubva mangwanani kusvika mauro, achipa upfakazi hwoumambo hwaMwari nokuedza kuvatendesa pamusoro paJesu zvichibva pamutemo waMozisi novaporofiti. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Asi vamwe vadotendesewa nozvaadonyaira, ukuwo vamwe havanai kutenda. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Saka, pavasinai kuwirirana pachavo, vadobirika, Phauro paanga wanyaira zvokuti, “Mweya Mutsvene wanga adokohoroka mukunyaira kumadzibaba yenyu kuburikidza namuporofiti Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Paadoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Enda kuvanhu vakareva uti kwavari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Muchanzva chaizvo asi musinganzvitsitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">futi muchaona asi musingaonetsetse,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />nokuti mwoyo yovanhu vakareva yatindivara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nonzeve dzavo dzaneta kunzva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">futi vatsinzina meso yavo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Nokuti vangadzoona nomeso yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nokunzva nonzeve dzavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nokunzvitsitsa nomwoyo yavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">vodzopindukira kwandiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kuti ndivaporese.’”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Mbazvizikane kwamuri kuti irori ruponiso raMwari ridotumihwa yamwe marudzi, vachatetekera. <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Paadonyaira mashoko yakareya, maJudha vadobirika ndokuthanga kupikisana pachavo.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Uye adogara pakarepo makore mairi yadozara achizviriritira mumba mache, nokutambira vese vaiuya kwaari, <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />achiparidza umambo hwaMwari nokudzidzisa pamusoro paIshe Jesu Khirisitu zviri pachenu uye asingatadzisiwe.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>